517\031classic-reference",[2241]="The Apple Falls\031Take Jannok's Rose to Syurna in Darnassus.\0313599\0314163\031\031\031-162\031classic-reference",[2242]="Destiny Calls\031Find Sethir the Ancient and bring back any clues that you may discover to Syurna.$B\0314163\0314163\031\031\031-162\031classic-reference",[225]="The Weathered Grave\031Speak with Sirra Von'Indi in Darkshire.\031\031268\031\031227\03110\031classic-reference",[2258]="Badlands Reagent Run\031Bring 5 Buzzard Gizzards, 10 Crag Coyote Fangs, and  5 Rock Elemental Shards to Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath, Badlands.\0316868\0316868\031\0312202\0313\031classic-reference",[2259]="Erion Shadewhisper\031Contact Erion Shadewhisper in Darnassus.$B\0313599\0314214\031\0312260\031-162\031classic-reference",[226]="Wolves at Our Heels\031Kill 12 Starving Dire Wolves and 8 Rabid Dire Wolves, then return to Lars at Sven's Camp on the western border of Duskwood.\031893\031893\031\031\03110\031classic-reference",[2260]="Erion's Behest\031Travel to Stormwind City and seek council with Renzik \"The Shiv.\"$B\0314214\0316946\031\031\031-162\031classic-reference",[227]="Morgan Ladimore\031Speak with Commander Althea Ebonlocke in Darkshire.\031268\031264\031225\031228\03110\031classic-reference",[2278]="The Platinum Discs\031Speak with stone watcher and learn what ancient lore it keeps.  Once you have learned what lore it has to offer, activate the Discs of Norgannon.\031\031\031\031\0311517\031classic-reference",[2279]="The Platinum Discs\031Take the miniature version of the Discs of Norgannon to the Explorers' League in Ironforge.\031\0315387\0312278\0312439\0311517\031classic-reference",[228]="Mor'Ladim\031Kill Mor'Ladim, then return his skull to Commander Althea Ebonlocke in Darkshire.\031264\031264\031227\031229\03110\031classic-reference",[2280]="The Platinum Discs\031Take the miniature version of the Discs of Norgannon to the one of the sages in Thunder Bluff.\031\0313978\0312278\0312440\0311517\031classic-reference",