5204\0317683\031\031238\0311497\031classic-reference",[233]="Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery\031Deliver the stack of letters to Talin Keeneye.\031658\031714\031179\031234\031132\031classic-reference",[2338]="Translating the Journal\031Let Jarkal borrow the necklace.  In exchange, he will translate the journal for you.\0316868\0316868\0312318\0312339\0311517\031classic-reference",[2339]="Find the Gems and Power Source\031Recover all three gems and a power source for the necklace from Uldaman, and then bring them to Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath.  Jarkal believes a power source might be found on the strongest construct present in Uldaman.$B$BFrom the journal, you know...$B* The ruby has been stashed in a barricaded Shadowforge area.$B* The topaz has been hidden in an urn in one of the Trogg areas, near some Alliance dwarves.$B* The sapphire has been claimed by Grimlok, the trogg leader.\0316868\0316868\0312338\0312340\0311517\031classic-reference",[234]="Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery\031Deliver the letter to Grelin Whitebeard.\031714\031786\031233\031\031132\031classic-reference",[2340]="Deliver the Gems\031Deliver the Necklace and Gem Salvage to Dran Droffers in Orgrimmar.\0316868\0316986\0312339\0312341\0311517\031classic-reference",[2341]="Necklace Recovery, Take 3\031Visit Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath to see if he was successful.\0316986\0316868\0312340\031\0311517\031classic-reference",[2342]="Reclaimed Treasures\031Get Patrick Garrett's family treasure from their family chest in the South Common Hall of Uldaman, and bring it to him in the Undercity.\0315651\0315651\031\031\0311517\031classic-reference",[235]="The Ashenvale Hunt\031Speak with Senani Thunderheart at Splintertree Post, Ashenvale.\03110880\03112696\031\031\0311637\031classic-reference",[2358]="Horns of Nez'ra\031Return the Horns of Nez'ra to Arantir's Shadow in Lakeshire.\0317009\0317009\031\031\031-162\031classic-reference",[2359]="Klaven's Tower\031Steal the Defias Tower Key, break into the Defias Tower and uncover the contents of the Duskwood Chest. Take whatever information you find back to Mathias Shaw in Stormwind. Read Kearnen's Journal to gain insight about the tower.$B\0317024\031332\0312360\0312607\031-162\031classic-reference",[2360]="Mathias and the Defias\031Travel to Westfall and find Agent Kearnen for your debriefing.\031332\0317024\031\0312359\031-162\031classic-reference",[2361]="Restoring the Necklace\031\0316826\0316826\0312204\031\0311517\031classic-reference",[237]="In Defense of the King's Lands\031Mountaineer Gravelgaw in the southern guard tower wants you to kill 10 Stonesplinter Skullthumpers and 10 Stonesplinter Seers and report back to him.\0311091\0311091\031224\031263\03138\031classic-reference",[2378]="Find the Shattered Hand\031Journey to Orgrimmar and speak with Shenthul at the Cleft of Shadow.\0316467\0313401\031\0312379\031-162\031classic-reference",[2379]="Zando'zan\031Speak with Zando'zan at the Cleft of Shadow.\0313401\0313402\031\0312382\031-162\031classic-reference",[238]="Errand for Apothecary Zinge\031Bring the Field Sampling Kit to Apothecary Zinge in the Undercity.\0317683\0315204\031232\031243\0311497\031classic-reference",[2380]="To Orgrimmar!\031Speak with Shenthul at the Cleft of Shadow in Orgrimmar.\0313170\0313401\031\0312379\031-162\031classic-reference",[2381]="Plundering the Plunderers\031Bring the Southsea Treasure back to Wrenix the Wretched in Ratchet. Do not forget to get an E.C.A.C. and Thieves' Tools from Wrenix's Gizmotronic Apparatus. You will need both of these items to complete your mission.$B$BShould you be attacked by any unusually hostile parrots, use your E.C.A.C.!$B$B\0317161\0317161\0312382\031\031-162\031classic-reference",[2382]="Wrenix of Ratchet\031Travel to Ratchet and speak with Wrenix the Wretched.\0313402\0317161\0312379\0312381\031-162\031classic-reference",[2383]="Simple Parchment\031Read the Simple Parchment and speak to Frang in the Valley of Trials.\0313143\0313153\031788\031\031-81\031classic-reference",[239]="Westbrook Garrison Needs Help!\031Go to the Westbrook Garrison and speak with Deputy Rainer.\031240\031963\03176\03111\03112\031classic-reference",[2398]="The Lost Dwarves\031Find Baelog in Uldaman.\0311356\0316906\031\0312240\0311517\031classic-reference",[2399]="The Sprouted Fronds\031\031\031\031931\031\031141\031classic-reference",[24]="Shadumbra's Head\031Bring Shadumbra's Head to Senani Thunderheart at Splintertree Post, Ashenvale.\031\03112696\0316383\031\031331\031classic-reference",[240]="Return to Jitters\031Return to Jitters with the Dusky Crab Cakes.\031272\031288\03193\031\03110\031classic-reference",[2418]="Power Stones\031Bring 8 Dentrium Power Stones and 8 An'Alleum Power Stones to Rigglefuzz in the Badlands.\0312817\0312817\031\031\0311517\031classic-reference",[243]="Into the Field\031Speak to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Gadgetzan about getting a power source for the testing kit.\0315204\0317407\031238\031379\031440\031classic-reference",[2438]="The Emerald Dreamcatcher\031Bring the Emerald Dreamcatcher to Tallonkai Swiftroot in Dolanaar.\0313567\0313567\031\0312459\031141\031classic-reference",[2439]="The Platinum Discs\031Take your reward voucher to Dinita Stonemantle in the Vault of Ironforge.\0315387\0317292\0312279\0312963\0311537\031classic-reference",[244]="Encroaching Gnolls\031Report to Deputy Feldon.\031464\0311070\031\031246\03144\031classic-reference",[2440]="The Platinum Discs\031Take the reward voucher to Bena Winterhoof in Thunder Bluff.\0313978\0313009\0312280\0312965\0311638\031classic-reference",[245]="Eight-Legged Menaces\031Kill 15 Pygmy Venom Web Spiders, and then report back to Watcher Dodds in Duskwood.\031888\031888\031\031\03110\031classic-reference",[2458]="Deep Cover\031Travel to the Venture Co. Tower, north of the Sludge Fen and contact the Shattered Hand's covert operative, Taskmaster Fizzule.$B$BWhen the tower is in sight, use the Flare Gun to signal your arrival to Taskmaster Fizzule. Fire off TWO flares, then approach Taskmaster Fizzule and perform the Shattered /Salute.$B$BThese actions must be performed in the correct order, as Fizzule will attack and terminate any person he does not recognize.\0313401\0317233\0312460\0312478\031-162\031classic-reference",[2459]="Ferocitas the Dream Eater\031Tallonkai Swiftroot in Dolanaar wants you to kill 7 Gnarlpine Mystics and find the Missing Jewel.\0313567\0313567\0312438\031\031141\031classic-reference",[246]="Assessing the Threat\031Kill 10 Redridge Mongrels and 6 Redridge Poachers, then report back to Deputy Feldon in Lakeshire.\0311070\0311070\031244\031\03144\031classic-reference",[2460]="The Shattered Salute\031Perform the Shattered Salute on Shenthul.\0313401\0313401\031\0312458\031-162\031classic-reference",[247]="The Hunt Completed\031\03112696\03112696\031\031\031331\031classic-reference",[2478]="Mission: Possible But Not Probable\031Steal Silixiz's Tower Key from Foreman Silixiz, then kill two Mutated Venture Co. Drones, two Venture Co. Patrollers, and two Venture Co. Lookouts.$B$BAssassinate Grand Foreman Gallywix and take his head, then pick the lock on Gallywix's lockbox and steal the Cache of Zanzil's Altered Mixture. Take the Cache and Gallywix's Head back to Shenthul in Orgrimmar for further instruction.$B\0317233\0313401\0312458\0312479\031-162\031classic-reference",[2479]="Hinott's Assistance\031Travel to Tarren Mill in Hillsbrad Foothills and deliver the Sample of Zanzil's Mixture to Serge Hinott.$B$BTo get to Tarren Mill, take the Zeppelin to the Undercity and follow the road south through Silverpine and towards Hillsbrad. Follow the signs!$B$B\0313401\0312391\0312478\0312480\031-162\031classic-reference",[248]="Looking Further\031Climb the intact watch tower beside Stonewatch Keep.$B$BFind a suitable container to place the Glyph of Azora.\031\031\03194\031249\03144\031classic-reference",[2480]="Hinott's Assistance\031Wait for Serge Hinott to complete the cure.\0312391\0312391\0312479\0