UCK!\031Find some Special Chicken Feed and return to your befriended chicken. When you find it, /cheer at it before trying to give it the Special Chicken Feed.\031620\031620\031\031\031-284\031classic-reference",[387]="Quell The Uprising\031Warden Thelwater of Stormwind wants you to kill 10 Defias Prisoners, 8 Defias Convicts, and 8 Defias Insurgents in The Stockade.\0311719\0311719\031\031\031717\031classic-reference",[388]="The Color of Blood\031Nikova Raskol of Stormwind wants you to collect 10 Red Wool Bandanas.\0311721\0311721\031\031\031717\031classic-reference",[3881]="Expedition Salvation\031Bring a Crate of Foodstuffs and Research Equipment to Williden Marshal in Un'Goro Crater.\0319270\0319270\031\031\031490\031classic-reference",[3882]="Roll the Bones\031Bring 8 Dinosaur Bones to Spark Nilminer in Un'Goro Crater.\0319272\0319272\031\031\031490\031classic-reference",[3883]="Alien Ecology\031Use the Scraping Vial to collect a Hive Wall Sample from one of the Gorishi hive hatcheries in Un'Goro Crater.  Look for the chambers with the hanging larval spawns.$B$BBring the Hive Wall Sample to Hol'anyee Marshal in Un'Goro Crater.\0319271\0319271\031\031\031490\031classic-reference",[3884]="Williden's Journal\031Return the journal to Williden Marshal somewhere in Un'Goro Crater.\031\0319270\031\031\031490\031classic-reference",[389]="Bazil Thredd\031Speak with Warden Thelwater in the Stockade.\0311646\0311719\031373\031391\0311519\031classic-reference",[39]="Deliver Thomas' Report\031Report to Marshal Dughan in Goldshire.\031261\031240\03171\03159\03112\031classic-reference",[3901]="Rattling the Rattlecages\031Kill 12 Rattlecage Skeletons, and then return to Shadow Priest Sarvis in Deathknell when you are done.\0311569\0311569\031364\031\031154\031classic-reference",[3902]="Scavenging Deathknell\031Search Deathknell and the vicinity for 6 pieces of Scavenged Goods, and return them to Deathguard Saltain.\0311740\0311740\031376\031\031154\031classic-reference",[3903]