ue\031Slay Emperor Dagran Thaurissan and free Princess Moira Bronzebeard from his evil spell. $B\0314949\0318929\0314002\0314004\0311584\031classic-reference",[4004]="The Princess Saved?\031Return to Thrall!$B\0318929\0314949\0314003\031\0311584\031classic-reference",[4005]="Aquementas\031Take the Book of Aquor, the Silvery Claws, and the Irontree Heart to Tanaris.$B$BUse the Book of Aquor to summon Aquementas.$B$BAfter you have the completed totem, take it to J.D. Collie in Marshal's Refuge.\0319116\0319117\0314084\0313961\031490\031classic-reference",[401]="Wait for Sirra to Finish\031Wait a moment, then speak with Sirra Von'Indi again.\031268\031268\031251\031252\03110\031classic-reference",[4021]="Counterattack!\031Bring a Piece of Krom'zar's Banner to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.\0313389\0313389\031852\031\03117\031classic-reference",[4022]="A Taste of Flame\031Show Cyrus Therepentous the Black Dragonflight Molt you received from Kalaran Windblade.$B\0319459\0319459\0313481\0314024\03146\031classic-reference",[4023]="A Taste of Flame\031Show Cyrus Therepentous proof of your worth.$B$BYou have a feeling that Cyrus already knows that you are unworthy.\0319459\0319459\031\0314024\03146\031classic-reference",[4024]="A Taste of Flame\031Travel to Blackrock Depths and slay Bael'Gar.$B$BYou only know that the giant resides inside Blackrock Depths. Remember to use the Altered Black Dragonflight Molt on Bael'Gar's remains to capture the Fiery Essence.$B$BReturn the Encased Fiery Essence to Cyrus Therepentous.$B$B\0319459\0319459\0314023\031\0311584\031classic-reference",[403]="Guarded Thunderbrew Barrel\031\031\031\031\031\0311\031classic-reference",[404]="A Putrid Task\031Bring 7 Putrid Claws to Deathguard Dillinger in Brill.\0311496\0311496\031\031426\03185\031classic-reference",[4041]="The Videre Elixir\031\0317775\0317775\031\031\031357\031classic-reference",[405]="The Prodigal Lich\031Present Sevren's Orders to Bethor Iceshard in the Undercity.\031149