ne.\031\03110219\0314681\031\031148\031classic-reference",[4732]="Beached Sea Turtle\031Take the Sea Turtle Remains to Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine.\031\03110219\0314681\031\031148\031classic-reference",[4733]="Beached Sea Creature\031Take the Sea Creature Bones to Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Auberdine.\031\03110219\0314681\031\031148\031classic-reference",[4734]="Egg Freezing\031Use the Eggscilloscope Prototype on an egg in the Rookery.\03110267\03110267\031\0314735\0311583\031classic-reference",[4735]="Egg Collection\031Bring 8 Collected Dragon Eggs and the Collectronic Module to Tinkee Steamboil at Flame Crest in the Burning Steppes.\03110267\03110267\0314734\0315522\0311583\031classic-reference",[4736]="In Search of Menara Voidrender\031Speak to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.\0315172\0316266\031\0311796\031-61\031classic-reference",[4737]="In Search of Menara Voidrender\031Speak to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.\0313326\0316266\031\0311796\031-61\031classic-reference",[4738]="In Search of Menara Voidrender\031Speak with Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.\031461\0316266\031\0311796\031-61\031classic-reference",[4739]="In Search of Menara Voidrender\031Speak to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.\0314563\0316266\031\0311796\031-61\031classic-reference",[474]="Defeat Nek'rosh\031Kill Chieftain Nek'rosh$B$BBring Nek'rosh's Head to Captain Stoutfist.\031\0312104\031465\031\03111\031classic-reference",[4740]="WANTED: Murkdeep!\031Find and slay the murloc known as Murkdeep.  The creature is thought to be defending the murloc huts south of Auberdine along the water.$B$BReport the death of Murkdeep to Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea in Auberdine.\031\0312930\031\031\031148\031classic-reference",[4741]="Wild Guardians\031Trull Failbane in Felwood wants you to hunt 13 Moontouched Owlbeasts.\03110306\03110306\0314521\0314721\031361\031classic-reference",[4742]="Seal of Ascension\031Find the three gemstones of command: The Gemstone of Smolderthorn, Gemstone of Spirestone, and Gemstone of Bloodaxe. Return them, along with the Unadorned Seal of Ascension, to Vaelan.$B$BThe Generals, as told to you by Vaelan, are: War Master Voone of the Smolderthorn; Highlord Omokk of the Spirestone; and Overlord Wyrmthalak  of the Bloodaxe.\03110296\03110296\031\0314743\0311583\031classic-reference",[4743]="Seal of Ascension\031Travel to the Wyrmbog in Dustwallow Marsh. Find the ancient drake, Emberstrife and beat him without mercy until his will is broken.$B$BIt is at that moment which you must place the Unforged Seal of Ascension before the great beast. You must then be quick to use the Orb of Draconic Energy on his weakened form and claim dominion over his mental faculties. Control the beast and force the Flames of the Black Dragonflight upon the Unforged Seal of Ascension!\03110296\03110296\0314742\031\0311583\031classic-reference",[475]="A Troubling Breeze\031Seek out Gaerolas Talvethren in Starbreeze Village.$B\0312078\0312107\031\031476\031141\031classic-reference",[476]="Gnarlpine Corruption\031Return to Athridas Bearmantle in Dolanaar.\0312107\0312078\031475\031483\031141\031classic-reference",[4761]="Thundris Windweaver\031Speak with Thundris Windweaver in Auberdine.\0313693\0313649\031984\0314762\031148\031classic-reference",[4762]="The Cliffspring River\031Travel north of Auberdine to the first waterfall along the Cliffspring River and draw a sample from the pool there.$B$BReturn to Thundris Windweaver in Auberdine with the Cliffspring River Sample.\0313649\0313649\0314761\0314763\031148\031classic-reference",[4763]="The Blackwood Corrupted\031Fill the Empty Cleansing Bowl at the Auberdine Moonwell.$B$BGather a sample of fruit, nut, and grain from the northern Blackwood furbolg camps.$B$BMix the bowl and place it near the bonfire closest to the Cliffspring River at the northern camp, thus summoning the satyr corruptor.$B$BTake the Talisman of Corruption and bring it to Thundris Windweaver in Auberdine.\0313649\0313649\0314762\031\031148\031classic-reference",[4764]="Doomrigger's Clasp\031Bring Doomrigger's Clasp to Mayara Brightwing in the Burning Steppes.\0319565\0319565\031\0314765\0311583\031classic-reference",[4765]="Delivery to Ridgewell\031Bring Ridgewell's Crate to Remington Ridgewell in Stormwind.\0319565\0312285\0314764\031\0311583\031classic-reference",[4766]="Mayara Brightwing\031Speak with Mayara Brightwing in the Burning Steppes.\0312285\0319565\031\0314764\0311583\031classic-reference",[4767]="Wind Rider\031Bring 10 Highperch Wyvern Eggs to Elu in Freewind Post.\03110377\03110377\031\031\031400\031classic-reference",[4768]="The Darkstone Tablet\031Bring the Darkstone Tablet to Shadow Mage Vivian Lagrave in Kargath.\0319078\0319078\031\031\0311583\031classic-reference",[4769]="Vivian Lagrave and the Darkstone Tablet\031Speak with Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave.\0315204\0319078\031\0314768\0311583\031classic-reference",[477]="Border Crossings\031Retrieve the contents of one of the Dalaran wizards' crates. You will find Pyrewood Village to the south.\0312121\031\031\031478\031130\031classic-reference",[4770]="Homeward Bound\031Escort Pao'ka Swiftmountain from Highperch, and then talk to Motega Firemane in Whitereach Post.\03110427\03110428\031\031\031400\031classic-reference",[4771]="Dawn's Gambit\031Place Dawn's Gambit in the Viewing Room of the Scholomance.  Defeat Vectus, then return to Betina Bigglezink.\03111035\03111035\0315531\031\0312057\031classic-reference",[478]="Maps and Runes\031Bring the strange pendant to Shadow Priest Allister at the Sepulcher.\031\0312121\031477\031481\031130\031classic-reference",[4781]="Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe\031Bring a Gold Bar to Xizk Goodstitch in Stranglethorn Vale.\0316266\0312670\0311796\0314782\031-61\031classic-reference",[4782]="Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe\031Return to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.\0312670\0316266\0314781\0314783\031-61\031classic-reference",[4783]="Components for the Enchanted Gold Bloodrobe\031