nok Steelspring\031Give Tinkee's Letter to Felnok Steelspring.\03110267\03110468\0314726\0314809\03146\031classic-reference",[4809]="Chillwind Horns\031Bring 8 Uncracked Chillwind Horns to Felnok Steelspring.\03110468\03110468\0314808\0314810\031618\031classic-reference",[481]="Dalar's Analysis\031Take the rune-inscribed pendant to Dalar Dawnweaver at the Sepulcher.\0312121\0311938\031478\031482\031130\031classic-reference",[4810]="Return to Tinkee\031Bring Felnok's Package to Tinkee Steamboil in the Burning Steppes.\03110468\03110267\0314809\0314907\031618\031classic-reference",[4811]="The Red Crystal\031Travel east of Auberdine and look for a large, red crystal along Darkshore's eastern mountain range.  Report back what you find to Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea in Auberdine.\0312930\0312930\031\0314812\031148\031classic-reference",[4812]="As Water Cascades\031Fill the Empty Water Tube at the Auberdine moonwell, and then investigate the red crystal along Darkshore's eastern mountain wall.\0312930\031\0314811\0314813\031148\031classic-reference",[4813]="The Fragments Within\031Report back what you have found to Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea in Auberdine.\031\0312930\0314812\031\031148\031classic-reference",[482]="Dalaran's Intentions\031Speak with Shadow Priest Allister at the Sepulcher.\0311938\0312121\031481\031479\031130\031classic-reference",[4821]="Alien Egg\031Return the Alien Egg to Hagar Lightninghoof in Freewind Post.\03110539\03110539\031\0314865\031400\031classic-reference",[4822]="You Scream, I Scream...\031Get some Strawberry Ice Cream for your ward.  The lad seems to prefer Tigule and Foror's brand ice cream.\03114305\03114305\031\031\031-284\031classic-reference",[483]="The Relics of Wakening\031Retrieve the Relics of Wakening and bring them to Athridas Bearmantle in Dolanaar.\0312078\0312078\031476\031486\031141\031classic-reference",[484]="Young Crocolisk Skins\031Obtain 4 Young Crocolisk Skins for James Halloran in Menethil Harbor.\0312094\0312094\031\031471\03111\031classic-reference",[4841]="Pacify the Centaur\031Kill 12 Galak Scouts, 10 Galak Wranglers, and 6 Galak Windchasers, and then return to Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Freewind Post.\03110537\03110537\0314542\0315064\031400\031classic-reference",[4842]="Strange Sources\031Follow Donova Snowden's instructions, then report back.\0319298\0319298\031980\031\031618\031classic-reference",[485]="Find OOX-09/HL!\031Take the distress beacon to Oglethorpe's homing robot at the head of the river in the Hinterlands, near Skulk Rock.\031\0317806\031\031836\03147\031classic-reference",[486]="Ursal the Mauler\031Kill Ursal the Mauler and return to Athridas Bearmantle in Dolanaar.\0312078\0312078\031483\031\031141\031classic-reference",[4861]="Enraged Wildkin\031Locate Jaron Stoneshaper's wrecked camp and supplies in southern Winterspring.\03110301\031\031\0314863\031618\031classic-reference",[4862]="En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why\031Travel to Blackrock Spire and collect 15 Spire Spider Eggs for Kibler.$B$BBy the sound of it, these eggs could be found near spiders.$B\03110260\03110260\031\031\0311583\031classic-reference",[4863]="Enraged Wildkin\031Find Jaron Stoneshaper's wrecked wagon.\031\031\0314861\0314864\031618\031classic-reference",[4864]="Enraged Wildkin\031Pick up Jaron's Supplies from the snow, then find the wildkin that stole the amulet Jaron spoke of.$B$BBring Jaron's Supplies and the Blue-feathered Amulet to Jaron Stoneshaper at the lodge in Winterspring.\031\03110301\0314863\031\031618\031classic-reference",[4865]="Serpent Wild\031Report your findings to Motega Firemane.\03110539\03110428\0314821\0315062\031400\031classic-reference",[4866]="Mother's Milk\031In the heart of Blackrock Spire you will find Mother Smolderweb. Engage her and get her to poison you. Chances are good that you will have to kill her as well. Return to Ragged John when you are poisoned so that he can 'milk' you.\0319563\0319563\031\031\0311583\031classic-reference",[4867]="Urok Doomhowl\031Read Warosh's Scroll.  Bring Warosh's Mojo to Warosh.\03110799\03110799\031\031\0311583\031classic-reference",[487]="The Road to Darnassus\031Slay 6 Gnarlpine Ambushers and return to Sentinel Amara Nightwalker outside of Dolanaar.\0312151\0312151\031\031\031141\031classic-reference",[488]="Zenn's Bidding\031Bring Zenn Foulhoof outside of Dolanaar 3 Nightsaber Fangs, 3 Strigid Owl Feathers and 3 swatches of Webwood Spider Silk.\0312150\0312150\031\031489\031141\031classic-reference",[4881]="Assassination Plot\031Warn Kanati Greycloud at Whitereach Post of the plot to kill him.\031\03110638\031\0314966\031400\031classic-reference",[4882]="Guarding Secrets\031Take the Blue-feathered Necklace to Trull Failbane at Bloodvenom Post.\031\03110306\031\0314883\031618\031classic-reference",[4883]="Guarding Secrets\031Take the Blue-feathered Necklace to Nara Wildmane.\03110306\0315770\0314882\031\031618\031classic-reference",[489]="Seek Redemption!\031Collect 3 Fel Cones and give them to Zenn Foulhoof outside of Dolanaar.\0312083\0312150\031488\031\031141\031classic-reference",[49]="Sweet Amber\031Grimbooze Thunderbrew wants a Sack of Barley, a Sack of Rye and a Sack of Corn.\031239\031239\03148\03150\03140\031classic-reference",[490]="Bounty: Gnarlpine Furbolg\031Shayla Nightbreeze on the road outside of Darnassus wants you to bring her 15 Gnarlpine Fangs.\031\031\031\031\031\031native",[4901]="Guardians of the Altar\031Protect Ranshalla while she attempts to reactivate the Altar of Elune. Report your findings to Erelas Ambersky in Rut'theran Village.\03110300\0317916\031979\0314902\031618\031classic-reference",[4902]="Wildkin of Elune\031Speak with Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.\0317916\0313516\0314901\031\031618\031classic-reference",[4903]="Warlord's Command\031Slay Highlord Omokk, War Master Voone, and Overlord Wyrmthalak. Recover Important Blackrock Documents. Return to Warlord Goretooth in Kargath when the mission has been accomplished.\031\0319077\031\0314941\0311583\031classic-reference",[4904]="Free at Last\031Escort Lakota Windsong from the Darkcloud Pinnacle, and then talk to Thalia Amberhide at Freewind Post.\03110646\03110645\031\031\031400\031classic-reference",[4906]="Further Corruption\031Eridan Bluewind in Felwood wants you to kill 8 Jadefire Hellcallers, 8 Jadefire Betrayers, 8 Jadefire Tricksters, and Xavaric. Return to Eridan when the task is completed.\0319116\0319116\0314421\031\031361\031classic-reference",[4907]="Tinkee Steamboil\031Speak with Tinkee Steamboil.\03110468\03110267\0314810\0314734\0311583\031classic-reference",[491]="Wand to Bethor\031Take the Woven Wand to Bethor Iceshard in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity.\031\0311498\031461\031\031130\031classic-reference",[492]="A New Plague\031Bring Johaan's Special Drink to the Captured Mountaineer.\0311518\0312211\031369\031\03185\031classic-reference",[4921]="Lost in Battle\031Find Mankrik's wife and then return to him in the Crossroads.\0313432\0313432\031\031\03117\031classic-reference",[493]="Journey to Hillsbrad Foothills\031Deliver Apothecary Renferrel's findings to Apothecary Lydon in the town of Tarren Mill in the Hillsbrad Foothills.\0311937\0312216\031\031\031130\031classic-reference",[494]="Time To Strike\031Travel to Tarren Mill to deliver Deathstalker Lesh's message to High Executor Darthalia.\0312214\0312215\031\031\031267\031classic-reference",[4941]="Eitrigg's Wisdom\031Speak with Eitrigg in Orgrimmar. When you have discussed matters with Eitrigg, seek council from Thrall.$B$BYou recall having seen Eitrigg in Thrall's chamber.\0319077\0314949\0314903\0314974\0311637\031classic-reference",[495]="The Crown of Will\031Report to Melisara at Tarren Mill in the Hillsbrad Foothills.\0312227\0312278\031\031518\0311497\031classic-reference",[496]="Elixir of Suffering\031Apothecary Lydon of Tarren Mill wants 10 Gray Bear Tongues and some Creeper Ichor.\0312216\0312216\031\031499\031267\031classic-reference",[4961]="Cleansing of the Orb of Orahil\031Kill the Demon of the Orb, then speak with Tabetha.\0316546\0316546\0311799\0314976\031-61\031classic-reference",[4962]="Shard of a Felhound\031Take the Felhas Ruby and use it on one of the Felhounds found in Desolace. After successful, bring the Felhas Ruby and the Imprisoned Felhound Spirit back to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.\0316254\0316266\031\031\031-61\031classic-reference",[4963]="Shard of an Infernal\031Take the Infus Emerald and use it on one of the Infernals found in Desolace. After successful, bring the Infus Emerald and the Imprisoned Infernal Spirit back to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.\0316252\0316266\031\031\031-61\031classic-reference",[4964]="The Completed Orb of Dar'Orahil\031Wait for Menara Voidrender to complete the Orb of Dar'Orahil and then speak to her again.\0316266\0316266\0314976\031\031-61\031classic-reference",[4965]="Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil\031Speak to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.\0315172\0316266\031\0311799\031-61\031classic-reference",[4966]="Protect Kanati Greycloud\031Protect Kanati Greycloud from the centaur attack.\03110638\03110638\0314881\031\031400\031classic-reference",[4967]="Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil\031Speak to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.\0313326\0316266\031\0311799\031-61\031classic-reference",[4968]="Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil\031Speak to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.\031461\0316266\031\0311799\031-61\031classic-reference",[4969]="Knowledge of the Orb of Orahil\031Speak to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.\0314563\0316266\031\0311799\031-61\031classic-reference",[4970]="Frostsaber Provisions\031Collect 5 Shardtooth Meats and 5 Chillwind Meats for Rivern Frostwind in Winterspring.\03110618\03110618\031\031\031618\031classic-reference",[4971]="A Matter of Time\031Use the Temporal Displacer near one of Andorhal's silos and uncover Temporal Parasites.$B$BSlay 10 Temporal Parasites, and then return the Temporal Displacer to Chromie in the Andorhal Inn, Western Plaguelands.\03110667\03110667\031\0314972\03128\031classic-reference",[4972]="Counting Out Time\031Locate 5 Andorhal Watches, found in lockboxes amongst the rubble of the city.  Return with them to Chromie in the Andorhal Inn, Western Plaguelands.\03110667\03110667\0314971\0314973\03128\031classic-reference",[4973]="Counting Out Time\031Locate 5 Andorhal Watches amongst the rubble of the city, and return with them to Chromie in the Andorhal Inn, Western Plaguelands.\03110667\03110667\0314972\031\03128\031classic-reference",[4974]="For The Horde!\031Travel to Blackrock Spire and slay Warchief Rend Blackhand. Take his head and return to Orgrimmar.\0314949\0314949\0314941\0316566\0311583\031classic-reference",[4975]="The Completed Orb of Noh'Orahil\031Wait for Menara Voidrender to complete the Orb of Noh'Orahil and then speak to her again.\0316266\0316266\0314976\031\031-61\031classic-reference",[4976]="Returning the Cleansed Orb\031Return the Cleansed Infernal Orb to Menara Voidrender in the Barrens.\0316546\0316266\0314961\031\031-61\031classic-reference",[498]="The Rescue\031Krusk in Tarren Mill needs you to free Drull and Tog'thar from Durnholde Keep.\0312229\0312229\031\031533\031267\031classic-reference",[4981]="Operative Bijou\031Travel to Blackrock Spire and find out what happened to Bijou.\0319080\03110257\031\0314982\0311583\031classic-reference",[4982]="Bijou's Belongings\031Find Bijou's Belongings and return them to her. You recall her mentioning that she stashed them on the bottom floor of the city.$B\03110257\03110257\0314981\0314983\0311583\031classic-reference",[4983]="Bijou's Reconnaissance Report\031Take Bijou's Reconnaissance Report back to Grandmaster Lexlort in Kargath.$B\03110257\0319080\0314982\031\0311583\031classic-reference",[4984]="The Wildlife Suffers Too\031Destroy 8 Diseased Wolves, and then return to Mulgris Deepriver at the Writhing Haunt, Western Plaguelands.$B$B\03110739\03110739\031\0314985\03128\031classic-reference",[4985]="The Wildlife Suffers Too\031Destroy 8 Diseased Grizzlies, and then return to Mulgris Deepriver at the Writhing Haunt, Western Plaguelands.\03110739\03110739\0314984\031\03128\031classic-reference",[4986]="Glyphed Oaken Branch\031Based on the magic enchanted within the Glyphed Oaken Branch, its delivery to the Cenarion Circle in Darnassus is the next step the tauren druid sought.  Seek one of the druids there for assistance.\03110739\0314217\0314985\031\03128\031classic-reference",[4987]="Glyphed Oaken Branch\031Based on the magic enchanted within the Glyphed Oaken Branch, its delivery to the Cenarion Circle in Thunder Bluff is the next step the tauren druid sought.  Seek one of the druids there for assistance.\03110739\0315770\0314985\031\03128\031classic-reference",[499]="Elixir of Suffering\031Give Umpi the Elixir of Suffering.\0312216\0312230\031496\031\031267\031classic-reference",[5]="Jitters' Growling Gut\031Speak with Chef Grual.\031288\031272\031\03193\03110\031classic-reference",[50]="Sweet Amber\031Grimbooze Thunderbrew wants Truesilver.\031239\031239\03149\03151\03140\031classic-reference",[500]="Crushridge Bounty\031Gather 9 Dirty Knucklebones from Crushridge ogres in the Alterac Mountains.  Bring them to Marshal Redpath in Southshore.\0312263\0312263\031\031504\03136\031classic-reference",[5001]="Bijou's Belongings\031Find Bijou's Belongings and return them to her. Good luck!$B\03110257\03110257\031\0315002\0311583\031classic-reference",[5002]="Message to Maxwell\031Travel to the Burning Steppes and give Bijou's Information to Marshal Maxwell.\03110257\0319560\0315001\0315081\0311583\031classic-reference",[501]="Elixir of Pain\031Bring 10 vials of Mountain Lion Blood to Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill.\0312216\0312216\031\031502\031267\031classic-reference",[502]="Elixir of Pain\031Feed the Elixir of Pain to Stanley.\0312216\0312274\031501\031\031267\031classic-reference",[5021]="Better Late Than Never\031The ramblings of the ghostly woman indicated that she needed a package delivered.  She claimed that it was where her horse was.  As to where the horse is or where the package was to be delivered - the ghost remains incomprehensible.\03110778\031\031\031\03128\031classic-reference",[5022]="Better Late Than Never\031Check with the Royal Factors of Stormwind to learn the whereabouts of an Emma Felstone.  There is usually a census officer located in City Hall.\031\03110782\0315021\0315048\03128\031classic-reference",[5023]="Better Late Than Never\031Check with the Royal Overseers of the Undercity to learn the whereabouts of a Jeremiah Felstone.  There is usually a census officer located near guild and tabard registration.\031\03110781\0315021\0315049\03128\031classic-reference",[503]="Gol'dir\031Free Gol'dir then return to Krusk in Tarren Mill.\0312229\0312316\031533\031506\031267\031classic-reference",[504]="Crushridge Warmongers\031Slay 10 Crushridge Warmongers, then return to Marshal Redpath in Southshore.\0312263\0312263\031500\031\03136\031classic-reference",[5041]="Supplies for the Crossroads\031Find and return Crossroads' Supply Crates to Thork in the Barrens.\0313429\0313429\031\031\03117\031classic-reference",[5042]="Agamaggan's Strength\031\0313430\0313430\0315052\031\03117\031classic-reference",[5043]="Agamaggan's Agility\031\0313430\0313430\0315052\031\03117\031classic-reference",[5044]="Wisdom of Agamaggan\031\0313430\0313430\0315052\031\03117\031classic-reference",[5045]="Rising Spirit\031\0313430\0313430\0315052\031\03117\031classic-reference",[5046]="Razorhide\031\0313430\0313430\0315052\031\03117\031classic-reference",[5047]="Finkle Einhorn, At Your Service!\031Talk to Malyfous Darkhammer in Everlook.\03110776\03110637\031\031\0311583\031classic-reference",[5048]="Good Natured Emma\031Find Ol' Emma in Stormwind and see if she is in fact Emma Felstone.  If she is, then perhaps she'd like the package Janice Felstone made for her.\03110782\0313520\0315022\0315050\0311519\031classic-reference",[5049]="The Jeremiah Blues\031Find Jeremiah Payson in the Undercity and see if he is in fact Jeremiah Felstone.  If he is, then perhaps he'd like the package Janice Felstone made for him.\03110781\0318403\0315023\0315050\0311497\031classic-reference",[505]="Syndicate Assassins\031Kill 12 Syndicate Footpads and 8 Syndicate Thieves, then return to Magistrate Henry Maleb in Southshore.\0312276\0312276\031\031\03136\031classic-reference",[5050]="Good Luck Charm\031Return to Janice Felstone in Western Plaguelands her Good Luck Half-Charm.\0313520,8403\03110778\031\0315051\03128\031classic-reference",[5051]="Two Halves Become One\031Locate the other half of the Good Luck Charm somewhere on the Felstone Farm in Western Plaguelands and reassemble it.$B$BGive the Good Luck Charm to Janice Felstone on the Felstone Farm, Western Plaguelands.\03110778\03110778\0315050\031\03128\031classic-reference",[5052]="Blood Shards of Agamaggan\031Bring a Blood Shard to Mangletooth in Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.$B$BCollect more Blood Shards if you want him to bless you with Agamaggan's power.\0313430\0313430\031878\031\03117\031classic-reference",[5054]="Ursius of the Shardtooth\031Storm Shadowhoof at Everlook in Winterspring wants you to kill Ursius.\03110303\03110303\031\0315055\031618\031classic-reference",[5055]="Brumeran of the Chillwind\031Storm Shadowhoof at Everlook in Winterspring wants you to kill Brumeran.\03110303\03110303\0315054\0315056\031618\031classic-reference",[5056]="Shy-Rotam\031Storm Shadowhoof at Everlook in Winterspring wants you to defeat Shy-Rotam.\03110303\03110303\0315055\0315057\031618\031classic-reference",[5057]="Past Endeavors\031Bring Storm Shadowhoof's Marker to Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff.\03110303\03110303\0315056\031\031618\031classic-reference",[5058]="Mrs. Dalson's Diary\031\031\031\031\031\03128\031classic-reference",[5059]="Locked Away\031\031\031\031\031\03128\031classic-reference",[506]="Blackmoore's Legacy\031Return the information gathered by Gol'dir to Krusk in Tarren Mill.\0312316\0312229\031503\031507\031267\031classic-reference",[5060]="Locked Away\031\031\031\031\031\03128\031classic-reference",[5061]="Aquatic Form\031Return to Darnassus and show Mathrengyl Bearwalker the Pendant of the Sea Lion.\03111802\0314217\031272\031\031-263\031classic-reference",[5062]="Sacred Fire\031Gather 10 bushels of Incendia Agave, and then consult Magatha Grimtotem on Elder Rise in Thunderbluff.\03110428\0314046\0314865\0315088\031400\031classic-reference",[5063]="Cap of the Scarlet Savant\031In order to create the Cap of the Scarlet Savant, you will be required to bring the following items back to Malyfous Darkhammer: 1 Pristine Hide of the Beast; 5 Frayed Abomination Stitchings; 8 Arcane Crystals; 5 Enchanted Scarlet Thread. $B$BYou will also be required to pay 50 gold pieces for the crafting of the item.\031\03110637\0315047\031\031618\031classic-reference",[5064]="Grimtotem Spying\031Locate and retrieve the three Secret Notes in Darkcloud Pinnacle.\03110537\03110537\0314841\031\031400\031classic-reference",[5065]="The Lost Tablets of Mosh'aru\031Bring the Third and Fourth Mosh'aru Tablets to Prospector Ironboot in Tanaris.\03110460\03110460\0313528\0314788\031139\031classic-reference",[5066]="A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands!\031Seek out Commander Ashlam Valorfist.  His base camp is located at Chillwind Camp, north of the Alterac Mountains.\0312198\03110838\031\0315092\0311519\031classic-reference",[5067]="Leggings of Arcana\031In order to create the Leggings of Arcana, you will be required to bring the following items back to Malyfous Darkhammer: 1 Pristine Hide of the Beast; 5 Frayed Abomination Stitchings; 5 Arcanite Bars; 5 Frostwhisper's Embalming Fluid.$B$BYou will also be required to pay 50 gold pieces for the crafting of the item.\031\03110637\0315047\031\031618\031classic-reference",[5068]="Breastplate of Bloodthirst\031In order to create the Breastplate of Bloodthirst, you will be required to bring the following items back to Malyfous Darkhammer: 1 Pri