eneral Drakkisath's Command to Marshal Maxwell in Burning Steppes.\031\0319560\031\0315102\0311583\031classic-reference",[509]="Elixir of Agony\031Bring 6 Mudsnout Blossoms to Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill.\0312216\0312216\031\031513\031267\031classic-reference",[5090]="A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands!\031Seek out Commander Ashlam Valorfist.  His base camp is located at Chillwind Camp, north of the Alterac Mountains.\03110877\03110838\031\0315092\0311537\031classic-reference",[5091]="A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands!\031Seek out Commander Ashlam Valorfist.  His base camp is located at Chillwind Camp, north of the Alterac Mountains.\03110878\03110838\031\0315092\0311657\031classic-reference",[5092]="Clear the Way\031Kill 10 Skeletal Flayers and 10 Slavering Ghouls in Sorrow Hill.$B$BReturn to Commander Ashlam Valorfist at Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands.\03110838\03110838\031\031\03128\031classic-reference",[5093]="A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands!\031Seek out High Executor Derrington.  His base camp is located at the Bulwark, east of Tirisfal Glade and the Undercity.\03110880\03110837\031\0315096\03128\031classic-reference",[5094]="A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands!\031Seek out High Executor Derrington.  His base camp is located at the Bulwark, east of Tirisfal Glade and the Undercity.\03110879\03110837\031\0315096\03128\031classic-reference",[5095]="A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands!\031Seek out High Executor Derrington.  His base camp is located at the Bulwark, east of Tirisfal Glades and the Undercity.\03110881\03110837\031\0315096\03128\031classic-reference",[5096]="Scarlet Diversions\031Proceed to the Scarlet Crusade's base camp between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears and destroy their command tent.$B$BPlace the Scourge banner at the camp, and then return to High Executor Derrington at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.\03110837\03110837\031\031\03128\031classic-reference",[5097]="All Along the Watchtowers\031Using the Beacon Torch, mark each tower in Andorhal; you will need to stand in the doorway of the tower to successfully mark it.$B$BOnce all four towers are marked, return the Beacon Torch to Commander Ashlam Valorfist in Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands.\03110838\03110838\0315092\031\03128\031classic-reference",[5098]="All Along the Watchtowers\031Using the Beacon Torch, mark each tower in Andorhal; you will need to stand in the doorway of the tower to successfully mark it.$B$BOnce all four towers are marked, return the Beacon Torch to High Executor Derrington at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.\03110837\03110837\0315096\031\03128\031classic-reference",[51]="Sweet Amber\031Bring a Sycamore Branch to Grimbooze Thunderbrew.\031239\031239\03150\03153\03140\031classic-reference",[510]="Foreboding Plans\031Bring the Foreboding Plans to Magistrate Maleb in Southshore.\031\0312276\031\031512\03136\031classic-reference",[5102]="General Drakkisath's Demise\031Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy General Drakkisath. Return to Marshal Maxwell when the job is done.$B\0319560\0319560\0315089\031\0311583\031classic-reference",[5103]="Hot Fiery Death\031Someone in this world must know what to do with these gauntlets. Good luck!\031\03110637\031\0315124\031-121\031classic-reference",[511]="Encrypted Letter\031Bring the Encrypted Letter to Loremaster Dibbs in Southshore.\031\0312277\031\031514\03136\031classic-reference",[512]="Noble Deaths\031Bring 7 Alterac Signet Rings to Magistrate Maleb in Southshore.\0312276\0312276\031510\031\03136\031classic-reference",[5121]="High Chief Winterfall\031Donova Snowden in Winterspring wants you to defeat High Chief Winterfall.\0319298\0319298\0315087\031\031618\031classic-reference",[5122]="The Medallion of Faith\031\03110917\03110917\031\0315125\0312017\031classic-reference",[5123]="The Final Piece\031Bring the Crudely-written Log to Donova Snowden in Winterspring.\031\0319298\0315087\0315128\031618\031classic-reference",[5124]="Fiery Plate Gauntlets\031Bring Malyfous Darkhammer 6 Enchanted Thorium Bars, 2 Essence of Fire, and 4 Star Rubies. You will also need to turn in your Unfired Plate Gauntlets.\03110637\03110637\0315103\031\031618\031classic-reference",[5125]="Aurius' Reckoning\031\03110917\03110917\0315122\031\0312017\031classic-reference",[5126]="Lorax's Tale\031Speak with Lorax. Listen to what he has to say.$B\03110918\03110918\031\0315127\031618\031classic-reference",[5127]="The Demon Forge\031Travel to Blackrock Spire and find Goraluk Anvilcrack. Slay him and then use the Blood Stained Pike upon his corpse. After his soul has been siphoned, the pike will be Soul Stained.$B$BYou must also find the Unforged Rune Covered Breastplate.$B$BReturn both the Soul Stained Pike and the Unforged Rune Covered Breastplate to Lorax in Winterspring.\03110918\03110918\0315126\031\0311583\031classic-reference",[5128]="Words of the High Chief\031Take the Crudely-written Log to Kelek Skykeeper in southern Felwood.\0319298\03110920\0315123\031\031618\031classic-reference",[513]="Elixir of Agony\031Take the Mudsnout Composite to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity.\0312216\0312055\031509\031515\031267\031classic-reference",[514]="Letter to Stormpike\031Take the Cleverly Encrypted Letter to Prospector Stormpike in Ironforge.\0312277\0311356\031511\031525\03136\031classic-reference",[5141]="Dragonscale Leatherworking\031Bring 2 Tough Scorpid Breastplates, 2 Tough Scorpid Gloves, and 10 Worn Dragonscales to Peter Galen in Azshara.$B$BCompleting this quest will give you access to the Dragonscale Leatherworking arts.$B$BThe completion of this quest will prevent you from learning Elemental Leatherworking and Tribal Leatherworking; be sure this is the path you wish to follow before doing so.\0317866\0317866\031\031\031-182\031classic-reference",[5142]="Little Pamela\031Find Pamela Redpath.\03110927\03110926\031\0315149\031139\031classic-reference",[5143]="Tribal Leatherworking\031Bring a Wild Leather Vest and a Wild Leather Helmet to Caryssia Moonhunter in Feralas.$B$BCompleting this quest will give you access to the Tribal Leatherworking arts.$B$BThe completion of this quest will prevent you from learning Dragonscale Leatherworking and Elemental Leatherworking; be sure this is the path you wish to follow before doing so.\0317870\0317870\031\031\031-182\031classic-reference",[5144]="Elemental Leatherworking\031Bring 2 Heart of Fire, 2 Globe of Water, 2 Core of Earth, and 2 Breath of Wind to Sarah Tanner in Searing Gorge.$B$BCompleting this quest will give you access to the Elemental Leatherworking arts.$B$BThe completion of this quest will prevent you from learning Dragonscale Leatherworking and Tribal Leatherworking; be sure this is the path you wish to follow before doing so.\0317868\0317868\031\031\031-182\031classic-reference",[5145]="Dragonscale Leatherworking\031Bring 2 Tough Scorpid Breastplates, 2 Tough Scorpid Gloves, and 10 Worn Dragonscales to Thorkaf Dragoneye in the Badlands.$B$BCompleting this quest will give you access to the Dragonscale Leatherworking arts.$B$BThe completion of this quest will prevent you from learning Elemental Leatherworking and Tribal Leatherworking; be sure this is the path you wish to follow before doing so.\0317867\0317867\031\031\031-182\031classic-reference",[5146]="Elemental Leatherworking\031Bring 2 Heart of Fire, 2 Globe of Water, 2 Core of Earth, and 2 Breath of Wind to Brumn Winterhoof in the Arathi Mountains.$B$BCompleting this quest will give you access to the Elemental Leatherworking arts.$B$BThe completion of this quest will prevent you from learning Dragonscale Leatherworking and Tribal Leatherworking; be sure this is the path you wish to follow before doing so.\0317869\0317869\031\031\031-182\031classic-reference",[5147]="Wanted - Arnak Grimtotem\031Slay Arnak Grimtotem and bring proof of your deed to Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Freewind Post.\031\03110537\031\031\031400\031classic-reference",[5148]="Tribal Leatherworking\031Bring a Wild Leather Vest and a Wild Leather Helmet to Se'Jib in Stranglethorn Vale.$B$BCompleting this quest will give you access to the Tribal Leatherworking arts.$B$BThe completion of this quest will prevent you from learning Dragonscale Leatherworking and Elemental Leatherworking; be sure this is the path you wish to follow before doing so.\0317871\0317871\031\031\031-182\031classic-reference",[5149]="Pamela's Doll\031Find Pamela's doll.\03110926\03110926\031\031\031139\031classic-reference",[515]="Elixir of Agony\031Bring the Mudsnout Mixture, a Strong Troll's Blood Potion, 5 Daggerspine Scales and 5 Torn Fin Eyes to Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill.\0312055\0312216\031513\031517\031267\031classic-reference",[5150]="Dadanga is Hungry!\031\0319274\0319274\031\031\031490\031classic-reference",[5151]="Hypercapacitor Gizmo\031Slay the beast and bring back the Hypercapacitor Gizmo and Panther Cage Key to Wizlo Bearingshiner.\03110941\03110941\031\031\031400\031classic-reference",[5152]="Auntie Marlene\031Speak with Marlene, south of the Ruins of Andorhal.\03110926\03110927\0315149\0315153\031139\031classic-reference",[5153]="A Strange Historian\031Bring Joseph's Wedding Ring to Chromie.\03110927\03110667\0315152\0315154\031139\031classic-reference",[5154]="The Annals of Darrowshire\031Bring the Annals of Darrowshire to Chromie in Andorhal.\03110667\03110667\0315153\0315210\03128\031classic-reference",[5155]="Forces of Jaedenar\031Enter Jaedenar and slay 4 Jaedenar Hounds, 4 Jaedenar Guardsmen, 6 Jaedenar Adepts, and 6 Jaedenar Cultists before returning to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.\03110922\03110922\031\0315157\031361\031classic-reference",[5156]="Verifying the Corruption\031Seek out and destroy 2 Entropic Beasts and 2 Entropic Horrors while exploring Shatter Scar Vale. After checking to see if the craters there are still filled with corrupt fel water, return to Taronn Redfeather in Felwood.\03110921\03110921\031\031\031361\031classic-reference",[5157]="Collection of the Corrupt Water\031Take the Empty Canteen t