 Flight, you will be required to bring the following items to Jeziba the 'Sculptor':$B$B1 Chromatic Carapace.$B$B10 Brilliant Chromatic Scales.$B$B10 Blood of Heroes.$B$B10 Frayed Abomination Stitchings.\031\03110976\0315164\031\03128\031classic-reference",[5167]="Legplates of the Chromatic Defier\031To forge the Legplates of the Chromatic Defier, you will be required to bring the following items to Jeziba the 'Sculptor':$B$B1 Chromatic Carapace.$B$B10 Brilliant Chromatic Scales.$B$B10 Blood of Heroes.$B$B5 Skin of Shadow.\031\03110976\0315164\031\03128\031classic-reference",[5168]="Heroes of Darrowshire\031Bring Davil's Libram and Redpath's Shield to Carlin Redpath.\03111063\03111063\0315210\031\031139\031classic-reference",[517]="Elixir of Agony\031Bring a keg of Shindigger Stout to Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill.\0312216\0312216\031515\031524\031267\031classic-reference",[518]="The Crown of Will\031Kill 10 Crushridge Maulers for Melisara in Tarren Mill.\0312278\0312278\031\031519\031267\031classic-reference",[5181]="Villains of Darrowshire\031Bring the Skull of Horgus and the Shattered Sword of Marduk to Carlin Redpath at Light's Hope Chapel.\03111063\03111063\0315210\031\031139\031classic-reference",[519]="The Crown of Will\031Kill Targ, Muckrake, and Glommus and bring their heads to Melisara in Tarren Mill.\0312278\0312278\031518\031520\031267\031classic-reference",[52]="Protect the Frontier\031Kill 8 Prowlers and 5 Young Forest Bears, and then return to Guard Thomas at the east Elwynn bridge.\031261\031261\031\031\03112\031classic-reference",[520]="The Crown of Will\031Kill Mug'Thol, and return his head with the Crown of Will to Melisara in Tarren Mill.\0312278\0312278\031519\031521\031267\031classic-reference",[5201]="Winterfall Intrusion\031Rivern Frostwind wants you to slay 5 Winterfall Shaman and 5 Winterfall Ursa.\03110618\03110618\031\031\031618\031classic-reference",[5202]="A Strange Red Key\031Search through Jaedenar to discover what the Blood Red Key is used for.\031\03111016\031\0315203\031361\031classic-reference",[5203]="Rescue From Jaedenar\031Escort Arko'narin to where Lightforge and her equipment are being held, and then protect her as you escape Shadow Hold. Afterwards, seek out Jessir Moonbow in Felwood to let her know what's happened to her friends.\03111016\03111019\0315202\0315204\031361\031classic-reference",[5204]="Retribution of the Light\031Return to Jaedenar and kill the succubus Rakaiah before finding the Remains of Trey Lightforge.\03111019\03111020\0315203\0315385\031361\031classic-reference",[5206]="Marauders of Darrowshire\031Bring 5 Resonating Skulls and the Mystic Crystal to Carlin Redpath in Eastern Plaguelands.\03111063\03111063\031\0315941\031139\031classic-reference",[521]="The Crown of Will\031Deliver the Crown of Will to Sharlindra in the Undercity.\0312278\0312227\031520\031\031267\031classic-reference",[5210]="Brother Carlin\031Bring the Extended Annals of Darrowshire to Carlin Redpath in Eastern Plaguelands.\03110667\03111063\0315154\0315181\031139\031classic-reference",[5211]="Defenders of Darrowshire\031Free 15 Darrowshire Spirits and return to Carlin Redpath.\03111063\03111063\0315241\031\031139\031classic-reference",[5212]="The Flesh Does Not Lie\031Recover 10 Plagued Flesh Samples from Stratholme and return them to Betina Bigglezink. You suspect that any creature in Stratholme would have said flesh sample.\03111035\03111035\031\0315213\0312017\031classic-reference",[5213]="The Active Agent\031Travel to Stratholme and search the ziggurats. Find and return new Scourge Data to Betina Bigglezink.$B\03111035\03111035\0315212\031\0312017\031classic-reference",[5214]="The Great Fras Siabi\031Find Fras Siabi's smoke shop in Stratholme and recover a box of Siabi's Premium Tobacco. Return to Smokey LaRue when the job is done.$B\03111033\03111033\031\031\0312017\031classic-reference",[5215]="The Scourge Cauldrons\031Speak with High Priestess MacDonnell at Chillwind Point, Western Plagu