 north. Search the supply crates that litter the city and recover 5 Stratholme Holy Water. Return to Leonid Barthalomew the Revered when you have collected enough of the blessed fluid.\03111036\03111036\031\031\0312017\031classic-reference",[5244]="The Ruins of Kel'Theril\031Speak with Jaron Stoneshaper in Starfall Village.\03111079\03110301\031\0315245\031618\031classic-reference",[5245]="Troubled Spirits of Kel'Theril\031Use Jaron's Pick to find the four Highborne Relic Fragments. Bring them to Aurora Skycaller in Eastern Plaguelands.\03110301\03110304\0315244\0315246\031618\031classic-reference",[5246]="Fragments of the Past\031Find the Sacred Highborne Writings in the Temple of Zin-Malor in Azshara, and bring them to Aurora Skycaller near the Northpass Tower in Eastern Plaguelands.\03110304\03110304\0315245\0315247\031139\031classic-reference",[5247]="Fragments of the Past\031Bring an Enchanted Thorium Bar, 5 Crystal Restore, and a Vial of Dire Water to Aurora Skycaller near the Northpass Tower in Eastern Plaguelands.\03110304\03110304\0315246\0315248\031139\031classic-reference",[5248]="Tormented By the Past\031Take the Crystal of Zin-Malor to Lake Kel'Theril in Winterspring and find a highborne spirit that will speak to you.\03110304\03110684\0315247\0315252\031139\031classic-reference",[5249]="To Winterspring!\031Find Starfall Village in Winterspring and speak with Wynd Nightchaser.\03110924\03111079\031\0315244\031361\031classic-reference",[525]="Further Mysteries\031Bring the Decrypted Letter to Magistrate Maleb in Southshore.\0311356\0312276\031514\031537\03136\031classic-reference",[5250]="Starfall\031Find Starfall in Winterspring and speak with Wynd Nightchaser.\0317907\03111079\031\0315244\031702\031classic-reference",[5251]="The Archivist\031Travel to Stratholme and find Archivist Galford of the Scarlet Crusade. Destroy him and burn down the Scarlet Archive.\03111039\03111039\031\0315262\0312017\031classic-reference",[5252]="Remorseful Highborne\031Speak with Wynd Nightchaser in Starfall Village, and ask about the proper place for the Crystal of Zin-Malor.\03110684\03111079\0315248\0315253\031618\031classic-reference",[5253]="The Crystal of Zin-Malor\031Deliver the Crystal of Zin-Malor to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.\03111079\0313516\0315252\031\031618\031classic-reference",[526]="Lightforge Ingots\031Gather 5 lightforge ingots, then return to Glorin Steelbrow in the Wetlands.\0311217\0311217\031324\031322\03110\031classic-reference",[5261]="Eagan Peltskinner\031Speak with Eagan Peltskinner.\031823\031196\031783\03133\0319\031classic-reference",[5262]="The Truth Comes Crashing Down\031Take the Head of Balnazzar to Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff in the Eastern Plaguelands.\031\03111039\0315251\0315263\0312017\031classic-reference",[5263]="Above and Beyond\031Venture to Stratholme and destroy Baron Rivendare. Take his head and return to Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff.$B\03111039\03111039\0315262\0315264\0312017\031classic-reference",[5264]="Lord Maxwell Tyrosus\031Speak with Lord Maxwell Tyrosus. He is inside the church.\03111039\03111034\0315263\0315265\031139\031classic-reference",[5265]="The Argent Hold\031Open the Argent Hold and claim your reward.\03111034\031\0315264\031\031139\031classic-reference",[527]="Battle of Hillsbrad\031Kill 6 Hillsbrad Farmhands, 6 Hillsbrad Farmers, Farmer Ray and Farmer Getz and report back to Darthalia in Tarren Mill.\0312215\0312215\031\031528\031267\031classic-reference",[528]="Battle of Hillsbrad\031Kill 15 Hillsbrad Peasants and report back to Darthalia in Tarren Mill.\0312215\0312215\031527\031529\031267\031classic-reference",[5281]="The Restless Souls\031Find Egan. You only know that he was last seen around Stratholme.\03111038\03111140\031\0315282\031139\031classic-reference",[5282]="The Restless Souls\031Use Egan's Blaster on the ghostly and spectral citizens of Stratholme. When the restless souls break free from their ghostly shells, use the blaster again - freedom will be theirs!$B$BFree 15 Restless Souls and return to Egan.\03111140\03111140\0315281\031\0312017\031classic-reference",[5283]="The Art of the Armorsmith\031To become an Armorsmith, you must make the following items and return them to Grumnus: 4 Ornate Mithril Helms, 2 Ornate Mithril Boots, 1 Ornate Mithril Breastplate.\0315164\0315164\031\031\031-121\031classic-reference",[5284]="The Way of the Weaponsmith\031To become a Weaponsmith, you must make the following items and return them to Ironus: 4 Moonsteel Broadswords, 4 Massive Iron Axes, 2 Heavy Mithril Axes, and 2 Big Black Maces.$B\03111146\03111146\031\031\031-121\031classic-reference",[529]="Battle of Hillsbrad\031Kill Blacksmith Verringtan and 4 Hillsbrad Apprentice Blacksmiths.$B$BRetrieve a shipment of iron and report back to Darthalia in Tarren Mill.\0312215\0312215\031528\031532\031267\031classic-reference",[53]="Sweet Amber\031Bring Grimbooze Thunderbrew a bundle of Charred Oak.\031239\031239\03151\031\03140\031classic-reference",[530]="A Husband's Revenge\031Kill Valdred Moray.$B$BBring his hands to Raleigh Andrean in the Undercity.\0312050\0312050\031441\031\031130\031classic-reference",[5301]="The Art of the Armorsmith\031To become an armorsmith, you must make the following items and return them to Okothos: 4 Ornate Mithril Helms, 2 Ornate Mithril Boots, 1 Ornate Mithril Breastplate.\03111177\03111177\031\031\031-121\031classic-reference",[5302]="The Way of the Weaponsmith\031To become a Weaponsmith, you must make the following items and return them to Borgosh: 4 Moonsteel Broadswords, 4 Massive Iron Axes, 2 Heavy Mithril Axes, and 2 Big Black Maces.$B\03111178\03111178\031\031\031-121\031classic-reference",[5305]="Sweet Serenity\031Travel to Stratholme and kill the Crimson Hammersmith. Recover the Crimson Hammersmith's Apron and return to Lilith.$B\03111191\03111191\031\031\031-121\031classic-reference",[5306]="Snakestone of the Shadow Huntress\031Travel to Blackrock Spire and slay Shadow Hunter Vosh'gajin. Recover Vosh'gajin's Snakestone and return to Kilram.\03111192\03111192\031\031\031-121\031classic-reference",[5307]="Corruption\031Find the Black Guard Swordsmith in Stratholme and destroy him. Recover the Insignia of the Black Guard and return to Seril Scourgebane.\03111193\03111193\031\031\031-121\031classic-reference",[531]="Vyrin's Revenge\031Bring Ol' Sooty's head to Vyrin Swiftwind at the Farstrider Lodge.\0311187\0311156\031271\031\03138\031classic-reference",[532]="Battle of Hillsbrad\031Kill Magistrate Burnside and 4 Hillsbrad Councilmen.  Destroy the Hillsbrad Proclamation.  Steal the Hillsbrad Town Registry.  Report back to Darthalia in Tarren Mill afterwards.\0312215\0312215\031529\031539\031267\031classic-reference",[5321]="The Sleeper Has Awakened\031Escort Kerlonian Evershade to Liladris Moonriver at Maestra's Post in Ashenvale.\03111218\03111219\031\031\031148\031classic-reference",[533]="Infiltration\031Retrieve information about Gol'dir's whereabouts for Krusk in Tarren Mill.\0312229\0312229\031498\031503\031267\031classic-reference",[5341]="Barov Family Fortune\031Venture to the Scholomance and recover the Barov family fortune. Four deeds make up this fortune: The Deed to Caer Darrow; The Deed to Brill; The Deed to Tarren Mill; and The Deed to Southshore. Return to Alexi Barov when you have completed this task.\03111022\03111022\031\0315342\0312057\031classic-reference",[5342]="The Last Barov\031Travel to Chillwind Camp - Alliance territory - and assassinate Weldon Barov. Take his head and return to Alexi Barov.$B$BBe warned, Weldon will probably be well protected by Alliance scum.\03111022\03111022\0315341\031\03128\031classic-reference",[5343]="Barov Family Fortune\031Venture to the Scholomance and recover the Barov family fortune. Four deeds make up this fortune: The Deed to Caer Darrow; The Deed to Brill; The Deed to Tarren Mill; and The Deed to Southshore. Return to Weldon Barov when you have completed this task.\03111023\03111023\031\