oy\" Duncan\031Get Catelyn's dagger from \"Pretty Boy\" Duncan.\0312542\0312542\031603\031611\03133\031classic-reference",[6101]="Taming the Beast\031Use the Taming Rod to tame a Nightsaber Stalker. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Dazalar in Dolanaar.\0313601\0313601\0316063\0316102\031-261\031classic-reference",[6102]="Taming the Beast\031Use the Taming Rod to tame a Strigid Screecher. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Dazalar in Dolanaar.\0313601\0313601\0316101\0316103\031-261\031classic-reference",[6103]="Training the Beast\031Speak to Jocaste in the Cenarion Enclave, in Darnassus.\0313601\0314146\0316102\031\031-261\031classic-reference",[611]="The Curse of the Tides\031Destroy the Altar of the Tides with Catelyn's Blade, kill Gazban and bring the Stone of the Tides and Catelyn's Blade back to Baron Revilgaz.\0312542\0312496\031610\031\03133\031classic-reference",[6121]="Lessons Anew\031Travel to Moonglade and speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven.\0314217\03111802\031\0316122\031-263\031classic-reference",[6122]="The Principal Source\031Use the Empty Cliffspring Falls Sampler to draw a sample of water from the mouth of the cave by the falls.$B$BDeliver the Filled Cliffspring Falls Sampler to Alanndarian Nightsong in Auberdine, Darkshore.\03111802\0313702\0316121\0316123\031-263\031classic-reference",[6123]="Gathering the Cure\031Bring 5 Earthroot and 12 Lunar Funguses to Alanndarian Nightsong in Auberdine so she may make a curative salve.\0313702\0313702\0316122\0316124\031-263\031classic-reference",[6124]="Curing the Sick\031Use the Curative Animal Salve on 10 Sickly Deer that are located throughout Darkshore; doing so should cure them.  Sickly Deer have been reported starting south of the Cliffspring River to the north of Auberdine and extending all the way into southern Darkshore where the edge of Ashenvale begins.\0313702\03111802\0316123\0316125\031-263\031classic-reference",[6125]="Power over Poison\031Return to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in the Cenarion Enclave, Darnassus.\03111802\0314217\0316124\031\031-263\031classic-reference",[6126]="Lessons Anew\031Travel to Moonglade and speak with Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven.\0313033\03111802\031\0316127\031-263\031classic-reference",[6127]="The Principal Source\031Use the Empty Dreadmist Peak Sampler to draw a sample of water from a pool at the top of the peak.$B$BDeliver the Filled Dreadmist Peak Sampler to Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads, Barrens.\03111802\0313448\0316126\0316128\031-263\031classic-reference",[6128]="Gathering the Cure\031Bring 5 Earthroot and 5 Kodo Horns to Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads so he may make a curative salve.\0313448\0313448\0316127\0316129\031-263\031classic-reference",[6129]="Curing the Sick\031Use the Curative Animal Salve on 10 Sickly Gazelles that are located throughout the northern part of the Barrens; doing so should cure them.  Sickly Gazelles have been reported north of the east-west road that runs through the Crossroads.\0313448\03111802\0316128\0316130\031-263\031classic-reference",[613]="Cracking Maury's Foot\031Bring Maury's Key to \"Sea Wolf\" Mackinley in Booty Bay.\0312501\0312501\031609\031\03133\031classic-reference",[6130]="Power over Poison\031Return to Turak Runetotem on the Elder Rise, Thunder Bluff.\03111802\0313033\0316129\031\031-263\031classic-reference",[6132]="Get Me Out of Here!\031Escort Melizza Brimbuzzle, then speak with Hornizz Brimbuzzle at the Kodo Graveyard in Desolace.\03112277\0316019\031\031\031405\031classic-reference",[6133]="The Ranger Lord's Behest\031Travel to the northern borders of the Eastern Plaguelands and recover the Quel'Thalas Registry. The item is somewhere in the Quel'Lithien lodge.$B$BYou must also slay 8 Rangers, 8 Pathstriders, and 8 Woodsmen.\03111878\03111878\031\0316135\031139\031classic-reference",[6134]="Ghost-o-plasm Round Up\031Bring 8 Ghost-o-plasms and the Crate of Ghost Magnets to Hornizz Brimbuzzle in Desolace.\0316019\0316019\031\031\031405\031classic-reference",[6135]="Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee...\031Find Duskwing and slay him. From the corpse, recover a Patch of Duskwing's Fur and return it to Nathanos Blightcaller.$B$BIt is said that Duskwing roams the countryside to the north of Marris Stead.\03111878\03111878\0316133\0316163\031139\031classic-reference",[6136]="The Corpulent One\031Find Borelgore in the northern wastes of Eastern Plaguelands and destroy him. Return to Nathanos Blightcaller when the mission is complete.\03111878\03111878\031\031\031139\031classic-reference",[614]="The Captain's Chest\031Bring Smotts' Chest to Hecklebury Smotts in Booty Bay.\031\031\031\031\03133\031classic-reference",[6141]="Brother Anton\031Speak with Brother Anton in Desolace.\03112336\0311182\031\031261\031405\031classic-reference",[6142]="Clam Bait\031Find 10 pieces of Soft-shelled Clam Meat and bring it back to Mai'Lahii at Shadowprey Village.\03112031\03112031\031\031\031405\031classic-reference",[6143]="Other Fish to Fry\031Slay 7 Slitherblade Myrmidon, 7 Slitherblade Naga, and 5 Slitherblade Sorceresses, and then talk to Drulzegar at Shadowprey in Desolace.\03112340\03112340\031\031\031405\031classic-reference",[6144]="The Call to Command\031Travel to the Undercity and speak with Varimathras.\03111878\0312425\031\0316145\031139\031classic-reference",[6145]="The Crimson Courier\031Return to Eastern Plaguelands and track down the Crimson Courier. Kill the Courier and recover the Grand Crusader's Command.$B$BTake the command to Nathanos Blightcaller for further instruction.\0312425\03111878\0316144\0316146\031139\031classic-reference",[6146]="Nathanos' Ruse\031Travel to Tyr's Hand, southeast of the Marris Stead. Once there, take a bite of the Rotten Apple. While under the guise of the Scarlet Crusade, deliver the Grand Crusader's Command to Crusader Lord Valdelmar.\03111878\03111898\0316145\0316147\031139\031classic-reference",[6147]="Return to Nathanos\031Return to Nathanos Blightcaller with the new information.$B\03111898\03111878\0316146\0316148\031139\031classic-reference",[6148]="The Scarlet Oracle, Demetria\031The Scarlet Crusade is on the move. Somewhere along the road from Tyr's Hand to Stratholme you will find the Oracle, Demetria, and her entourage. Hunt her down and slay her. Return to Nathanos Blightcaller should you succeed.\03111878\03111878\0316147\031\031139\031classic-reference",[615]="The Captain's Cutlass\031Speak with Sprogger.\031\031\0318552\0318554\03133\031classic-reference",[616]="The Haunted Isle\031Speak with Baron Revilgaz in Booty Bay.\031773\0312496\031\031578\03133\031classic-reference",[6161]="Claim Rackmore's Treasure!\031Find Rackmore's Silver Key.  Find Rackmore's Golden Key.  Find and open Rackmore's Chest.\031\031\031\031\031405\031classic-reference",[6162]="A Husband's Last Battle\031Kill Overlord Ror and return his claw to Dreka'Sur at Bloodvenom Post in Felwood.\0319620\0319620\031\031\031361\031classic-reference",[6163]="Ramstein\031Travel to Stratholme and slay Ramstein the Gorger. Take his head as a souvenir for Nathanos.\03111878\03111878\0316135\031\0312017\031classic-reference",[6164]="Augustus' Receipt Book\031Bring Augustus' Receipt Book to Augustus the Touched in Terrordale.\03112384\03112384\031\031\031139\031classic-reference",[617]="Akiris by the Bundle\031Bring 10 Bundles of Akiris Reed to Privateer Bloads in Booty Bay.\0312494\0312494\031\031623\03133\031classic-reference",[618]="Facing Negolash\031Bring 10 Barbecued Buzzard Wings and 5 bottles of Junglevine Wine to Captain Smotts' Lifeboat.$B$BKill Negolash, and bring Smotts' Cutlass to Captain Smotts in Stranglethorn.\031\031\031615\031\03133\031classic-reference",[6181]="A Swift Message\031Bring Lewis' Note to Thor the gryphon master.\031491\031523\031\0316281\03140\031classic-reference",[6182]="The First and the Last\031Speak with Mathias Shaw in Old Town Stormwind. He resides in the Barracks.\0311748\031332\031\03