orge.\031\0312786\031652\031687\03145\031classic-reference",[654]="Tanaris Field Sampling\031Acquire acceptable samples for 8 basilisks, 8 hyenas, and 8 scorpions.  Bring the testing kit back to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Gadgetzan before the power source runs out.\031\0317407\031379\031864\031440\031classic-reference",[6541]="Report to Kadrak\031Report to Kadrak at the watch tower in northern Barrens.\0313429\0318582\031\0316543\03117\031classic-reference",[6542]="Report to Kadrak\031Report to Kadrak at the watch tower in northern Barrens.\03111821\0318582\031\0316543\031406\031classic-reference",[6543]="The Warsong Reports\031Open the Bundle of Reports.  Take the Warsong Reports to the Warsong Scout, Warsong Runner, and Warsong Outrider. Bring back the updates they give you to Kadrak at the northern watch tower in the barrens.\0318582\0318582\031\031\03117\031classic-reference",[6544]="Torek's Assault\031Escort Torek on his attack against Silverwing Outpost and Duriel Moonfire, then report to Ertog Ragetusk at Splintertree Post.\03112858\03112877\031\031\031331\031classic-reference",[6545]="Warsong Runner Update\031\03112863\03112863\031\031\031331\031classic-reference",[6546]="Warsong Outrider Update\031\03112864\03112864\031\031\031331\031classic-reference",[6547]="Warsong Scout Update\031\03112862\03112862\031\031\031331\031classic-reference",[6548]="Avenge My Village\031Kill 8 Grimtotem Ruffians and 6 Grimtotem Mercenaries, and then return to Makaba Flathoof near the southeastern edge of Stonetalon.$B\03111857\03111857\031\0316629\031406\031classic-reference",[655]="Hammerfall\031Speak with Tor'gan in Hammerfall.\0312792\0312706\031\031672\03145\031classic-reference",[65593]="Hearts of the Lovers\031Bring the hearts of Avelina Lilly and Isaac Pearson to Carendin Halgar in the Temple of the Damned.\031\031\031\031\031\031native",[65597]="The Binding\031Using the Lovers' Hearts, summon and subdue an incubus, then return the Lovers' Hearts to Carendin Halgar 