mongst the Clan\031\03113840\03113840\0317163\0317165\0312597\031classic-reference",[7165]="Earned Reverence\031\03113840\03113840\0317164\0317166\0312597\031classic-reference",[7166]="Legendary Heroes\031\03113840\03113840\0317165\0317167\0312597\031classic-reference",[7167]="The Eye of Command\031\03113840\03113840\0317166\031\0312597\031classic-reference",[7168]="Rise and Be Recognized\031\03113841\03113841\0317162\0317169\0312597\031classic-reference",[7169]="Honored Amongst the Guard\031\03113841\03113841\0317168\0317170\0312597\031classic-reference",[717]="Tremors of the Earth\031Use the Sign of the Earth to activate the Pillars of Amethyst, Opal, and Diamond and obtain the Runestones.$B$BPlace the runestones in the Seal of the Earth to free Blacklash and Hematus.$B$BSlay them and return Blacklash's Bindings, the Chains of Hematus, and the Sign of the Earth to Garek.\0312888\0312888\031732\031\0313\031classic-reference",[7170]="Earned Reverence\031\03113841\03113841\0317169\0317171\0312597\031classic-reference",[7171]="Legendary Heroes\031\03113841\03113841\0317170\0317172\0312597\031classic-reference",[7172]="The Eye of Command\031\03113841\03113841\0317171\031\0312597\031classic-reference",[718]="Mirages\031Retrieve the Supply Crate for Sigrun Ironhew.\0312860\0312860\031\031733\0313\031classic-reference",[7181]="The Legend of Korrak\031According to legend, the leader of the mighty Winterax trolls appears at will to wreak havoc on the denizens of Alterac Valley.$B$BShould Korrak make himself known, destroy him and return to Warmaster Laggrond.\031\03113840\031\031\0312597\031classic-reference",[719]="A Dwarf and His Tools\031Find Ryedol's Lucky Pick and return it to Prospector Ryedol south of Hammertoe's Dig Site.\0312910\0312910\031\031\0313\031classic-reference",[72]="The Legend of Stalvan\031Search through the packed up possessions for a clue.\031297\031\03170\03174\03110\031classic-reference",[720]="A Sign of Hope\031Find Prospector Ryedol and let him know Hammertoe Grez is alive.\031\0312910\031\031721\0313\031classic-reference",[7201]="The Last Element\031Travel to Blackrock Depths and recover 10 Essence of the Elements. Your first inclination is to search the golems and golem makers. You remember Vivian Lagrave also muttering something about elementals.$B\0319078\0319078\031\031\0311584\031classic-reference",[7202]="Korrak the Bloodrager\031According to legend, the leader of the mighty Winterax trolls appears at will to wreak havoc on the denizens of Alterac Valley.$B$BShould Korrak make himself known, destroy him and return to Lieutenant Haggerdin in the Alterac Mountains.\031\03113841\031\031\0312597\031classic-reference",[721]="A Sign of Hope\031Find Hammertoe Grez in Uldaman.\0312910\0312909\031720\031722\0311517\031classic-reference",[722]="Amulet of Secrets\031Find Hammertoe's Amulet and return it to him in Uldaman.\0312909\0312909\031721\031723\0311517\031classic-reference",[7221]="Speak with Prospector Stonehewer\031Speak with Prospector Stonehewer in the Dun Baldar garrison.\031\03113816\031\0317141\0312597\031classic-reference",[7222]="Speak with Voggah Deathgrip\031Speak with Voggah in Frostwolf Keep.\031\03113817\031\0317142\0312597\031classic-reference",[7223]="Armor Scraps\031Bring 20 Armor Scraps to Murgot Deepforge in Dun Baldar.\03113257\03113257\031\0316781\0312597\031classic-reference",[7224]="Enemy Booty\031Bring 20 Armor Scraps to Smith Regzar in Frostwolf Village.\03113176\03113176\031\0316741\0312597\031classic-reference",[723]="Prospect of Faith\031Take Hammertoe's Amulet to Prospector Ryedol in the Badlands.\0312909\0312910\031722\031724\0313\031classic-reference",[724]="Prospect of Faith\031Take Hammertoe's Amulet to Historian Karnik in Ironforge.\0312910\0312916\031723\031725\0313\031classic-reference",[7241]="In Defense of Frostwolf\031Venture to Alterac Valley, located in the Alterac Mountains. Find and speak with Warmaster Laggrond - who stands outside the tunnel entrance - to begin your career as a soldier of Frostwolf. You will find Alterac Valley north of Tarren Mill at the base of the Alterac Mountains.\03113842\03113840\031\031\0312597\031classic-reference",[725]="Passing Word of a Threat\031Find Advisor Belgrum and give him his note.\0312916\0312918\031724\031726\0313\031classic-reference",[726]="Passing Word of a Threat\031Speak to Historian Karnik.\0312918\0312916\031725\031762\0313\031classic-reference",[7261]="The Sovereign Imperative\031Travel to Alterac Valley in the Hillsbrad Foothills. Outside of the entrance tunnel, find and speak with Lieutenant Haggerdin.$B$BFor the glory of Bronzebeard!\03113843\03113841\031\031\0312597\031classic-reference",[727]="To Ironforge for Yagyin's Digest\031Give the Sigil of the Hammer to Gerrig Bonegrip in the Forlorn Cavern of Ironforge.\0312785\0312786\031709\031735\0313\031classic-reference",[728]="To the Undercity for Yagyin's Digest\031Bring the Sigil of the Hammer to Keeper Bel'dugur in the Undercity.\0312785\0312934\031709\031736\0313\031classic-reference",[7281]="Brotherly Love\031Travel into Stormpike territory and slay Commander Karl Philips. Return to Commander Louis Philips when the task is complete.$B\03113154\03113154\031\031\0312597\031classic-reference",[7282]="Brotherly Love\031Travel into Frostwolf territory and slay Commander Louis Philips. Return to Commander Karl Philips when the task is complete.$B\03113320\03113320\031\031\0312597\031classic-reference",[729]="The Absent Minded Prospector\031Travel south and check on Prospector Remtravel.\0312913\0312917\031\031731\031148\031classic-reference",[730]="Trouble In Darkshore?\031Travel to Auberdine and look for signs of the dwarven excavation team.\0312912\0312913\031\031729\0311657\031classic-reference",[7301]="Fallen Sky Lords\031Travel to Frostwolf territory and search for Wing Commander Slidore, Wing Commander Vipore, and Wing Commander Ichman. Return to Commander Duffy should you complete your mission.\03113319\03113319\031\0