eldrin in Athenaeum.$B$BReturn to the Shen'dralar Ancient in the courtyard should you complete this quest.\03114358\03114358\031\0317877\0312557\031classic-reference",[7462]="The Treasure of the Shen'dralar\031Return to the Athenaeum and find the Treasure of the Shen'dralar. Claim your reward!\03114358\031\0317461\031\0312557\031classic-reference",[7463]="Arcane Refreshment\031Travel to the Warpwood Quarter of Dire Maul and slay the water elemental, Hydrospawn. Return to Lorekeeper Lydros in the Athenaeum with the Hydrospawn Essence.\03114368\03114368\031\031\0312557\031classic-reference",[747]="The Hunt Begins\031Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to bring him 7 Plainstrider Feathers and 7 pieces of Plainstrider Meat.\0312980\0312980\031\031\031220\031classic-reference",[748]="Poison Water\031Bring 6 Prairie Wolf Paws and 4 Plainstrider Talons to Mull Thunderhorn in Bloodhoof.\0312948\0312948\031\031754\031215\031classic-reference",[7481]="Elven Legends\031Search Dire Maul for Kariel Winthalus. Report back to Sage Korolusk at Camp Mojache with whatever information that you may find.\03114373\03114373\031\031\0312557\031classic-reference",[7482]="Elven Legends\031Search Dire Maul for Kariel Winthalus. Report back to Scholar Runethorn at Feathermoon with whatever information that you may find.\03114374\03114374\031\031\0312557\031classic-reference",[7483]="Libram of Rapidity\031Bring a Libram of Rapidity, 1 Pristine Black Diamond, 2 Large Brilliant Shards, and 2 Blood of Heroes to Lorekeeper Lydros in Dire Maul to receive an Arcanum of Rapidity.\03114368\03114368\031\031\0312557\031classic-reference",[7484]="Libram of Focus\031Bring a Libram of Focus, 1 Pristine Black Diamond, 4 Large Brilliant Shards, and 2 Skin of Shadow to Lorekeeper Lydros in Dire Maul to receive an Arcanum of Focus.\03114368\03114368\031\031\0312557\031classic-reference",[7485]="Libram of Protection\031Bring a Libram of Protection, 1 Pristine Black Diamond, 2 Large Brilliant Shards, and 1 