ssic-reference",[7499]="Codex of Defense\031Return the book to its rightful owners.\031\03114383\031\031\0312557\031classic-reference",[75]="The Legend of Stalvan\031Marshal Haggard wants you to check the chest upstairs for the Faded Journal Page.\031294\031294\03174\03178\03110\031classic-reference",[750]="The Hunt Continues\031Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to bring him 10 Mountain Cougar Pelts.\0312980\0312980\031747\031780\031220\031classic-reference",[7500]="The Arcanist's Cookbook\031Return the book to its rightful owners.\031\03114383\031\031\0312557\031classic-reference",[7501]="The Light and How To Swing It\031Return the book to its rightful owners.\031\03114382\031\031\0312557\031classic-reference",[7502]="Harnessing Shadows\031Return the book to its rightful owners.\031\03114382\031\031\0312557\031classic-reference",[7503]="The Greatest Race of Hunters\031Return the book to its rightful owners.\031\03114382\031\031\0312557\031classic-reference",[7504]="Holy Bologna: What the Light Won't Tell You\031Return the book to its rightful owners.\031\03114381\031\031\0312557\031classic-reference",[7505]="Frost Shock and You\031Return the book to its rightful owners.\031\03114381\031\031\0312557\031classic-reference",[7506]="The Emerald Dream...\031Return the book to its rightful owners.\031\03114381\031\031\0312557\031classic-reference",[7507]="Foror's Compendium\031Return Foror's Compendium of Dragon Slaying to the Athenaeum.\031\03114368\031\0317508\0312557\031classic-reference",[7508]="The Forging of Quel'Serrar\031Give the Dull and Flat Elven Blade to Lorekeeper Lydros.\031\03114368\0317507\0317509\0312557\031classic-reference",[7509]="The Forging of Quel'Serrar\031You must get Onyxia to breathe fire on the Unfired Ancient Blade. Once this is done, pick up the now Heated Ancient Blade. Be warned, a Heated Ancient Blade will not remain heated forever - time is of the essence.$B$BThe last step before returning to me is to slay the beast and drive the Heated Ancient Blade into her corpse.$B$BDo this and Quel'Serrar will be yours.\03114368\03114368\0317508\031\0312159\031classic-reference",[751]="The Ravaged Caravan\031Return the Venture Co. Documents to Morin Cloudstalker near Bloodhoof Village.\031\0312988\031749\031\031215\031classic-reference",[752]="A Humble Task\031Chief Hawkwind wants you to search for his mother near the water well to the southeast of Camp Narache.\0312981\0312991\031\031753\031220\031classic-reference",[753]="A Humble Task\031Take a Water Pitcher from the water well.$B$BReturn the pitcher to Chief Hawkwind in Camp Narache which is northwest from the water well.\0312991\0312981\031752\031755\031220\031classic-reference",[754]="Winterhoof Cleansing\031Use the Winterhoof Cleansing Totem at the Winterhoof Water Well, then return to Mull Thunderhorn.\0312948\0312948\031748\031756\031215\031classic-reference",[7541]="Service to the Horde\031\0314047\0314047\0311262\031\03115\031classic-reference",[755]="Rites of the Earthmother\031Travel to Seer Graytongue who lives in the hills directly south of Camp Narache.\0312981\0312982\031753\031757\031220\031classic-reference",[756]="Thunderhorn Totem\031Bring 6 Stalker Claws and 6 Cougar Claws to Mull Thunderhorn.\0312948\0312948\031754\031758\031215\031classic-reference",[7562]="Mor'zul Bloodbringer\031Speak with Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes.\0315520,5815,6382,12807\03114436\031\0317563\031-61\031classic-reference",[7563]="Rage of Blood\031Bring 30 bottles of Raging Beast's Blood to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes.\03114436\03114436\0317562\0317564\031-61\031classic-reference",[7564]="Wildeyes\031Bring the Case of Blood to Gorzeeki Wildeyes in the Burning Steppes.\03114436\03114437\0317563\031\031-61\031classic-reference",[757]="Rite of Strength\031Kill Bristlebacks in Brambleblade Ravine and bring 12 Bristleback Belts to Chief Hawkwind in Camp Narache.\0312982\0312981\031755\031763\031220\031classic-reference",[758]="Thunderhorn Cleansing\031Use the Thunderhorn Cleansing Totem at the Thunderhorn Water Well, then return to Mull.\0312948\0312948\031756\031759\031215\031classic-reference",[7581]="The Prison's Bindings\031Travel to Dire Maul in Feralas and recover 15 Satyr Blood from the Wildspawn Satyr that inhabit the Warpwood Quarter. Return to Daio in the Tainted Scar when this is done.$B\03114463\03114463\031\0317583\031-61\031classic-reference",[7582]="The Prison's Casing\031Travel to Darkwhisper Gorge in Winterspring and recover 5 Tears of the Hederine from the Hederine demons that occupy the gorge. Return to Daio in the Tainted Scar when you have completed this task.\03114463\03114463\031\0317583\031-61\031classic-reference",[7583]="Suppression\031Venture forth into the Tainted Scar and locate a Doomguard Commander.$B$BUse the Glowing Crystal Prison on the Doomguard Commander. Be prepared for a ferocious onslaught of attacks, as the demon attempts to escape capture.$B$BShould you succeed, return the Imprisoned Doomguard to Daio in the Tainted Scar.\03114463\03114463\031\031\031-61\031classic-reference",[759]="Wildmane Totem\031Bring 8 Prairie Alpha Teeth to Mull Thunderhorn in Bloodhoof Village.\0312948\0312948\031758\031760\031215\031classic-reference",[76]="The Jasperlode Mine\031Explore the Jasperlode Mine, then report back to Marshal Dughan in Goldshire.\031240\031240\03162\031239\03112\031classic-reference",[760]="Wildmane Cleansing\031Use the Wildmane Cleansing Totem at the Wildmane Water Well, then return to Mull Thunderhorn.\0312948\0312948\031759\031\031215\031classic-reference",[7601]="What Niby Commands\031Speak with Impsy in Felwood.\03114469\03114470\031\0317602\031-61\031classic-reference",[7602]="Flawless Fel Essence\031Impsy in Felwood has asked that you bring him three Flawless Fel Essences originating from three distinct locations.$B$BThe Legashi Satyrs of Azshara hold the Flawless Fel Essence of their region. The Jaedenar Legionnaires of Jaedenar hold the Flawless Fel Essence of their region. The Felguard Sentries of the Blasted Lands hold the Flawless Fel Essence of their region.$B$BRecover the Flawless Fel Essences and return  to Impsy in Felwood.\03114470\03114470\0317601\0317603\031-61\031classic-reference",[7603]="Kroshius' Infernal Core\031Search Shatter Scar Vale in Felwood for the remains of Kroshius. When you locate the remains, use the Fel Fire near them and await Kroshius' return. When the infernal has awoken, slay him and take from his corpse Kroshius' Infernal Core.$B$BReturn Kroshius' Infernal Core to Niby the Almighty in Felwood.\03114470\03114469\0317602\031\031-61\031classic-reference",[7604]="A Binding Contract\031Turn the Thorium Brotherhood Contract in to Lokhtos Darkbargainer if you would like to receive the plans for Sulfuron.\031\03112944\031\031\0311584\031classic-reference",[761]="Swoop Hunting\031Bring 8 Trophy Swoop Quills to Harken Windtotem in Bloodhoof Village.\0312947\0312947\031\031\031215\031classic-reference",[76156]="Stalk With The Earthmother\031Sneak into the Venture Company mine southeast of Thunder Bluff and collect 5 Seaforium Mining Charges from carts of blasting supplies, then return them to Boarton Shadetotem in Thunder Bluff.\031\031\031\031\031\031native",[76160]="Stalk With The Earthmother\031Gather 8 Windfury Cones north of Thunder Bluff, use them with the Mortar and Pestle, then return to Boarton Shadetotem in Thunder Bluff with the result.\031\031\031\031\031\031native",[762]="An Ambassador of Evil\031Kill Ambassador Infernus in Angor Fortress and bring proof of his death to Advisor Belgrum in Ironforge.\0312916\0312918\031726\0311139\0313\031classic-reference",[7621]="A Warning\031\03114494\03114494\031\031\031-262\031classic-reference",[7622]="The Balance of Light and Shadow\031Save 50 Peasants before 15 are slain. Speak with Eris Havenfire should you accomplish this task.$B$BYou may view the Death Post to view how many Peasants have been slain.\03114494\03114494\031\031\031-262\031classic-reference",[7623]="Lord Banehollow\031Purchase Shadowy Potions from Gorzeeki in the Burning Steppes.$B$BUse the potions to travel through Jaedenar, and speak with Lord Banehollow.\03114437\0319516\031\0317624\031-61\031classic-reference",[7624]="Ulathek the Traitor\031Confront Ulathek, then bring The Traitor's Heart to Lord Banehollow in Jaedenar.\0319516\0319516\0317623\0317625\031-61\031classic-reference",[76240]="Stalk With The Earthmother\031Buy or catch a Raw Brilliant Smallfish, then use the Knife Set to fillet it in front of Boarton Shadetotem in Thunder Bluff.\031\031\031\031\031\031native",[7625]="Xorothian Stardust\031Purchase Xorothian Stardust from Ur'dan.  Bring it to Gorzeeki Wildeyes in the Burning Steppes.\0319516\03114437\0317624\031\031-61\031classic-reference",[7626]="Bell of Dethmoora\031Bring 10 Elixirs of Shadow Power to Gorzeeki Wildeyes in the Burning Steppes.\03114436\03114437\0317564\031\031-61\031classic-reference",[7627]="Wheel of the Black March\031Bring 6 Large Brilliant Shards and 25 Dark Iron Ore to Gorzeeki in the Burning Steppes.\03114436\03114437\0317564\031\031-61\031classic-reference",[7628]="Doomsday Candle\031Bring 35 Black Dragonscales to Gorzeeki Wildeyes in the Burning Steppes.\03114436\03114437\0317564\031\031-61\031classic-reference",[7629]="Imp Delivery\031Bring the Imp in a Jar to the alchemy lab in the Scholomance.  After the parchment is created, return the jar to Gorzeeki Wildeyes.\03114437\03114437\031\031\031-61\031classic-reference",[763]="Rites of the Earthmother\031Take the Totem of Hawkwind to Baine Bloodhoof in Bloodhoof Village. Follow the road out of Camp Narache.\0312981\0312993\031757\031767\031220\031classic-reference",[7630]="Arcanite\031Bring 3 Arcanite Bar to Gorzeeki in the Burning Steppes.\03114437\03114437\031\031\031-61\031classic-reference",[7631]="Dreadsteed of Xoroth\031Read Mor'zul's Instructions.  Summon a Xorothian Dreadsteed, defeat it, then bind its spirit to you.\03114436\03114504\031\031\031-61\031classic-reference",[7632]="The Ancient Leaf\031Find the owner of the Ancient Petrified Leaf. Good luck, $N; It's a big world.\031\03114524\031\031\031-261\031classic-reference",[7633]="An Introduction\031\03114524\03114524\031\031\031-261\031classic-reference",[7634]="Ancient Sinew Wrapped Lamina\031Hastat the Ancient has asked that you bring him a Mature Blue Dragon Sinew. Should you find this sinew, return it to Hastat in Felwood.\03114526\03114526\0317632\031\031-261\031classic-reference",[7635]="A Proper String\031Stoma the Ancient has asked that you bring him a Mature Black Dragon Sinew. Should you find this sinew, return it to Stoma in Felwood.\03114525\03114525\0317632\031\031-261\031classic-reference",[7636]="Stave of the Ancients\031You must find and destroy these four demonic corrupters:$B$BSimone the Seductress.$B$BKlinfran the Crazed.$B$BSolenor the Slayer.$B$BArtorius the Doombringer.$B$BDestroy these creatures and return to Vartrus the Ancient in Felwood with their heads.$B$BRefer to the Petrified Bark in your inventory for clues as to their whereabouts.$B$BYou MUST complete this task by yourself.\03114524\03114524\0317632\031\031-261\031classic-reference",[7637]="Emphasis on Sacrifice\031Travel to Ironforge and get High Priest Rohan's Exorcism Censer.  You will need to make a donation of 150 gold in order to secure it.\031928\03111406\031\0317639\031-141\031classic-reference",[7638]="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker\031Speak with Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind's Cathedral District.\0316171\031928\031\031\031-141\031classic-reference",[7639]="To Show Due Judgment\031Return the Exorcism Censer to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind.\03111406\031928\0317637\0317640\031-141\031classic-reference",[764]="The Venture Co.\031Kill 14 Venture Co. Workers and 6 Venture Co. Supervisors for Morin Cloudstalker at Bloodhoof Village.\0312988\0312988\031751\031\031215\031classic-reference",[7640]="Exorcising Terrordale\031Use the Exorcism Censer to drive out the spirits that torment Terrordale.  When you have slain 25 Terrordale Spirits, return to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind.\031928\031928\0317639\0317641\031-141\031classic-reference",[7641]="The Work of Grimand Elmore\031Speak with Grimand Elmore in Stormwind's Dwarven District.\031928\0311416\0317640\0317642\031-141\031classic-reference",[7642]="Collection of Goods\031Bring 40 Runecloth, 6 Arcanite Bars, 10 Arthas' Tears, 5 Stratholme Holy Water vials, and 150 gold to Grimand Elmore in the Dwarven District of Stormwind.\0311416\0311416\0317641\031\031-141\031classic-reference",[7643]="Ancient Equine Spirit\031Acquire special horse feed used for feeding a spirit horse.  Merideth Carlson in Southshore apparently is the source for such food.$B$BTravel to the Dire Maul dungeon in Feralas and slay Tendris Warpwood.  Doing so will free the Ancient Equine Spirit.  Feed it the special horse feed, thereby soothing the spirit.  Finally, give it the Arcanite Barding so it may bless it.\031928\03114566\0317642\0317644\031-141\031classic-reference",[7644]="Blessed Arcanite Barding\031Return with the Blessed Arcanite Barding to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind.\03114566\031928\0317643\0317646\031-141\031classic-reference",[7645]="Manna-Enriched Horse Feed\031Retrieve 20 Enriched Manna Biscuits - the key ingredient in making Manna-Enriched Horse Feed - for Merideth Carlson at Southshore in the Hillsbrad Foothills.  The Argent Dawn is known as the sole purveyor of the biscuits.$B$BYou also need to give her 50 gold to soothe her ruffled sensibilities.\0312357\0312357\031\031\031-141\031classic-reference",[7646]="The Divination Scryer\031Bring an Azerothian Diamond and a Pristine Black Diamond to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind.\031928\031928\0317644\0317647\031-141\031classic-reference",[7647]="Judgment and Redemption\031Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance.  Doing so will bring forth the spirits you must judge.  Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver.  Defeat him and reclaim the lost soul of the fallen charger.$B$BGive the Charger's Redeemed Soul and the Blessed Enchanted Barding to Darkreaver's Fallen Charger.\031928\03114568\0317646\0317666\031-141\031classic-reference",[7648]="Grimand's Finest Work\031Take the Arcanite Barding to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind's Cathedral District for his inspection.\0311416\031928\0317642\031\031-141\031classic-reference",[7649]="Enchanted Thorium Platemail: Volume I\031Return the book to its rightful owners.\031\03114368\031\031\031-121\031classic-reference",[765]="Supervisor Fizsprocket\031Kill Supervisor Fizsprocket and return his clipboard to Morin Cloudstalker at Bloodhoof Village.\0312988\0312988\031751\031\031215\031classic-reference",[7650]="Enchanted Thorium Platemail: Volume II\031Return the book to its rightful owners.\031\03114368\031\031\031-121\031classic-reference",[7651]="Enchanted Thorium Platemail: Volume III\031Return the book to its rightful owners.\031\03114368\031\031\031-121\031classic-reference",[7652]="A Blue Light Bargain\031\03114567\03114567\031\031\031-121\031classic-reference",[7653]="Imperial Plate Belt\031\03114567\03114567\0317652\031\031-121\031classic-reference",[7654]="Imperial Plate Boots\031\03114567\03114567\0317652\031\031-121\031classic-reference",[7655]="Imperial Plate Bracer\031\03114567\03114567\0317652\031\031-121\031classic-reference",[7656]="Imperial Plate Chest\031\03114567\03114567\0317652\031\031-121\031classic-reference",[7657]="Imperial Plate Helm\031\03114567\03114567\0317652\031\031-121\031classic-reference",[7658]="Imperial Plate Leggings\031\03114567\03114567\0317652\031\031-121\031classic-reference",[7659]="Imperial Plate Shoulders\031\03114567\03114567\0317652\031\031-121\031classic-reference",[766]="Mazzranache\031Bring a Prairie Wolf Heart, Flatland Cougar Femur, Plainstrider Scale and Swoop Gizzard to Maur Raincaller at Bloodhoof Village.\0313055\0313055\031\031\031215\031classic-reference",[7660]="Wolf Swapping - Arctic Wolf\031\0313362\0313362\031\031\0311637\031classic-reference",[7661]="Wolf Swapping - Red Wolf\031\0313362\0313362\031\031\0311637\031classic-reference",[7662]="New Kodo - Teal\031\0313685\0313685\031\031\0311638\031classic-reference",[7663]="New Kodo - Green\031\0313685\0313685\031\031\0311638\031classic-reference",[7664]="Ivory Raptor Replacement\031\0317952\0317952\031\031\03114\031classic-reference",[7665]="Red Raptor Replacement\031\0317952\0317952\031\031\03114\031classic-reference",[7666]="Again Into the Great Ossuary\031\031928\031928\0317647\031\031-141\031classic-reference",[7667]="Material Assistance\031If you are interested in helping Sagorne Crestrider in Orgrimmar's Valley of Wisdom, bring him an Azerothian Diamond and a Pristine Black Diamond.\03113417\03113417\031\0318258\031-82\031classic-reference",[767]="Rite of Vision\031Speak with Zarlman Two-Moons in Bloodhoof Village.\0312993\0313054\031763\031771\031215\031classic-reference",[7671]="Frostsaber Replacement\031\0314730\0314730\031\031\0311657\031classic-reference",[7672]="Nightsaber Replacement\031\0314730\0314730\031\031\0311657\031classic-reference",[7673]="Frost Ram Exchange\031\0311261\0311261\031\031\0311\031classic-reference",[7674]="Black Ram Exchange\031\0311261\0311261\031\031\0311\031classic-reference",[7675]="Icy Blue Mechanostrider Replacement\031\0317955\0317955\031\031\0311\031classic-reference",[7676]="White Mechanostrider Replacement\031\0317955\0317955\031\031\0311\031classic-reference",[7677]="White Stallion Exchange\031If you bring me your white stallion, I'll trade you for one from the new herd. The new horse will be just as fast as your old one, but have a different look to it. You can look at the swift steeds here to see what it will look like.$B$BMUST PAY 500 Gold too....\031384\031384\031\031\03112\031classic-reference",[7678]="Palomino Exchange\031\031384\031384\031\031\03112\031classic-reference",[768]="Gathering Leather\031Bring 12 pieces of Light Leather to Veren Tallstrider in Thunder Bluff.\0313050\0313050\031\031\0311638\031classic-reference",[769]="Kodo Hide Bag\031Bring 4 Light Leather and 4 Coarse Thread to Veren Tallstrider in Thunder Bluff.\0313050\0313050\031\031\0311638\031classic-reference",[77]="A Sticky Situation\031Recover 10 bottles of Hinterlands Honey Ripple from the crates located around the abandoned Horde base in Skulk Rock.\0317801\0317801\031650\03181\03147\031classic-reference",[770]="The Demon Scarred Cloak\031Find someone who knows of Ghost Howl.\031\0313052\031\031\031215\031classic-reference",[7701]="WANTED: Overseer Maltorius\031Deep within the Slag Pit of the Cauldron, in the Searing Gorge, you will find the traitorous Dark Iron dwarf named Overseer Maltorius.$B$BSlay Overseer Maltorius and take his head. Return the head to Lookout Captain Lolo Longstriker in the Searing Gorge for your reward.\031\03114634\031\031\03151\031classic-reference",[7703]="Unfinished Gordok Business\031Find the Gauntlet of Gordok Might and return it to Captain Kromcrush in Dire Maul.$B$BAccording to Kromcrush, the \"old timey story\" says that Tortheldrin - a \"creepy\" elf who called himself a prince - stole it from one of the Gordok kings.\03114325\03114325\031\031\0312557\031classic-reference",[7704]="Look at the Size of It!\031Take Chambermaid Pillaclencher's Pillow to Evonice Sootsmoker in the Searing Gorge.\031\03114628\031\031\03151\031classic-reference",[771]="Rite of Vision\031Collect 2 Well Stones and 2 Ambercorn and bring them back to Zarlman Two-Moons in Bloodhoof Village.\0313054\0313054\031767\031772\031215\031classic-reference",[772]="Rite of Vision\031Consume the Water of the Seers in front of the tribal fire in Bloodhoof Village and follow the vision once it appears.\0313054\0312984\031771\031773\031215\031classic-reference",[7721]="Fuel for the Zapping\031Collect 10 Water Elemental Cores from the Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays along the Forgotten Coast of Feralas, and bring them back to Zorbin Fandazzle who is near the dock there.\03114637\03114637\031\0317726\031357\031classic-reference",[7722]="What the Flux?\031Somewhere in the Slag Pit of the Cauldron you will find the Secret Plans: Fiery Flux that Overseer Maltorius stole. Find those plans and return them to Master Smith Burninate in the Searing Gorge.$B\03114624\03114624\031\031\03151\031classic-reference",[7723]="Curse These Fat Fingers\031Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Heavy War Golems.$B$BThe Heavy War Golems wander the areas surrounding the Cauldron in the Searing Gorge. When you've killed enough, return to Hansel in Searing Gorge.\03114627\03114627\031\031\03151\031classic-reference",[7724]="Fiery Menace!\031Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Greater Lava Spiders in the Searing Gorge. You can find Greater Lava Spiders in the plateaus and lava pools of the Searing Gorge.$B$BReturn to Hansel Heavyhands in the Searing Gorge when you have killed enough Greater Lava Spiders.\03114627\03114627\031\031\03151\031classic-reference",[7725]="Again With the Zapped Giants\031Use Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker to zap any kind of giant found in Feralas into a more manageable form.  Bring 10 Miniaturization Residues found on the zapped versions of these giants to Zorbin Fandazzle at the docks of the Forgotten Coast, Feralas.\03114637\03114637\0317003\031\031357\031classic-reference",[7726]="Refuel for the Zapping\031Collect 6 Water Elemental Cores from the Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays along the Forgotten Coast of Feralas, and bring them back to Zorbin Fandazzle who is near the dock there.\03114637\03114637\0317721\031\031357\031classic-reference",[7727]="Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It\031Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Incendosaurs.$B$BYou will find Incendosaurs occupying the lava pools inside the Slag Pit. The Slag Pit can be found in the Cauldron of the Searing Gorge.$B$BReturn to Hansel Heavyhands in the Searing Gorge when you have killed enough Incendosaurs.\03114627\03114627\031\031\03151\031classic-reference",[7728]="STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass\031Find and return the Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass to Taskmaster Scrange in the Searing Gorge.$B$BThe only information you have about these items is the following: They were definitely stolen by Dark Iron dwarves. The Smithing Tuyere is a blacksmithing tool used by blacksmiths and the Lookout's Spyglass is an invaluable monitoring tool to lookouts.\031\03114626\031\031\03151\031classic-reference",[7729]="JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition\031Slay 15 Dark Iron Taskmasters and 15 Dark Iron Slavers. Return to Taskmaster Scrange in the Searing Gorge once you have accomplished this task.\031\03114626\031\031\03151\031classic-reference",[773]="Rite of Wisdom\031Travel to Red Rocks east of Thunder Bluff and speak with the Ancestral Spirit.\0312984\0312994\031772\031775\031215\031classic-reference",[7730]="Zukk'ash Infestation\031Bring 20 Zukk'ash Carapaces to Hadoken Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas.\0317875\0317875\0312903\031\031357\031classic-reference",[7731]="Stinglasher\031Defeat Stinglasher in the Writhing Deep, bringing its glands back to Hadoken Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas.\0317875\0317875\0312903\031\031357\031classic-reference",[7732]="Zukk'ash Report\031Deliver the Camp Mojache Zukk'ash Report to Zilzibin Drumlore.  He resides in the Drag of Orgrimmar.\0317875\0317010\031\031\031357\031classic-reference",[7733]="Improved Quality\031Bring 10 Rage Scar Yeti Hides to Pratt McGrubben at Feathermoon Stronghold, Feralas.\0317852\0317852\0312821\031\031357\031classic-reference",[7734]="Improved Quality\031Bring 10 Rage Scar Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas.\0317854\0317854\0312822\031\031357\031classic-reference",[7735]="Pristine Yeti Hide\031Bring the Pristine Yeti Hide to Pratt McGrubben at the Feathermoon Stronghold, Feralas.\031\0317852\031\031\031357\031classic-reference",[7736]="Restoring Fiery Flux Supplies via Kingsblood\031Deliver 2 Incendosaur Scales, 4 Kingsblood and one Coal to Master Smith Burninate.\03114624\03114624\0317722\031\03151\031classic-reference",[7737]="Gaining Acceptance\031\03114624\03114624\0317722\031\03151\031classic-reference",[7738]="Perfect Yeti Hide\031Bring the Perfect Yeti Hide to Jangdor Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas.\031\0317854\031\031\031357\031classic-reference",[775]="Journey into Thunder Bluff\031Speak with Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff.\0312994\0313057\031773\031776\031215\031classic-reference",[776]="Rites of the Earthmother\031Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff wants you to bring him the Horn of Arra'chea.\0313057\0313057\031775\031\031215\031classic-reference",[7761]="Blackhand's Command\031That is one stupid orc. It would appear as if you need to find this brand and gain the Mark of Drakkisath in order to access the Orb of Command.$B$BThe letter indicates that General Drakkisath guards the brand. Perhaps you should investigate.\031\031\031\031\0311583\031classic-reference",[777]="This Is Going to Be Hard\031Bring Cog #5 to Lotwil Veriatus.\0312920\0312921\031734\031778\0313\031classic-reference",[778]="This Is Going to Be Hard\031Defeat the Fam'retor Guardian and bring Lotwil's Shackles of Elemental Binding back to Lotwil Veriatus.\0312921\0312921\031777\031\0313\031classic-reference",[7781]="The Lord of Blackrock\031Return the Head of Nefarian to Highlord Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind.\031\0311748\031\0317782\0311519\031classic-reference",[7782]="The Lord of Blackrock\031Venture to the Valley of Heroes in Stormwind City and speak with Field Marshal Afrasiabi.\0311748\03114721\0317781\031\0311519\031classic-reference",[7783]="The Lord of Blackrock\031Return the Head of Nefarian to Thrall in Orgrimmar.\031\0314949\031\0317784